&lt;div id=&quot;processing-state-26-summary&quot; class=&quot;processing-state_details ng-trigger ng-trigger-menuExpansion ng-tns-c879422873-771 is-gpi-avatar ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About commercetools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;response-content ng-tns-c263290053-769&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;model-response-message-contentr_bfb50fc8f1f4512c&quot; class=&quot;markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real innovation starts with a strong foundation, and at commercetools, that comes from the perfect balance of our product and our people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Behind every leap forward is a collective of builders, explorers, doers, makers, and problem-solvers.The kind of people who not only pioneered a more flexible approach to commerce architecture but also shaped the culture of experimentation that approach unlocked. Together they are the engine of commerce innovation today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At commercetools, we power the next era of autonomous commerce for our customers. Whether it’s AI-driven solutions that help enterprises make smarter business decisions, bridging digital and physical shopping experiences, or enabling entirely new ways for industries to connect with their customers, we help the world’s most ambitious companies experiment, scale, and grow without limits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here the best idea wins, not the loudest voice. You will have the tools, trust, and space to not only build the future of commerce, but to build your own.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-2853&quot;&gt;You own AI capabilities end-to-end:&amp;nbsp; from the data and context that feed a model, through agent orchestration, to the generative UI a user sees and trusts. You&#39;ve personally shipped and operated full-stack apps in production, so backend, frontend, data, and ML aren&#39;t four teams you coordinate with, they&#39;re four things you do. You&#39;re not a research scientist; you wield models and engineer ruthlessly around their uncertainty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build agent loops and orchestration: tool use, structured outputs, business-rule enforcement, graceful failure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the integration layer (via MCP) that lets agents securely call backend systems and business APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Render model output into live, streamed, accessible UI via generative-UI protocols&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ground models in real data: retrieval, embeddings, and feedback loops that actually close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Treat evals as a first-class system - provable improvement, not vibes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take a capability from prompt-in-a-notebook to a measured, guard-railed production feature&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-2837&quot;&gt;This is a full time hybrid role location in either&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;57&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-2837&quot;&gt;Berlin, Munich, London or Valencia&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3&quot;&gt;What Sets Y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3&quot;&gt;ou Apart&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;You&#39;re a creative problem-solver who is wired to find solutions. You confidently dive into complex challenges and have a talent for making them simple for others. Your curiosity drives you to constantly grow and contribute to an environment of trust and teamwork. Great ideas come from many paths, and your unique perspective matters more than checking every box. What matters most is the mindset you bring to the work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;You bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shipped full-stack apps to production and owned them end-to-end: frontend through backend to deploy and operate, not handed off at a layer boundary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years shipping production software, 2+ building with LLMs in production (real users, not demos)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with UI protocols (A2UI, AG-UI, MCP-UI, or similar). You&#39;ve built against a generative/agent-driven UI protocol, not just consumed a REST API&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The AI spine: prompt/context engineering, agents, tool use, structured outputs, evals, MCP Python and TypeScript/Node + React; comfortable with async, streaming, and observability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working fluency with retrieval/embeddings and SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-2822&quot;&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fine-tuning/distillation, e-commerce or marketplace systems, and a track record in 0→1&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Because work and life are connected, our benefits are too. We’ve designed them to give you the security, flexibility, and opportunities you need to focus on what matters most.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🩺 &lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive health benefits&lt;/strong&gt; for you and your dependents, including access to OpenUp for personalized mental health support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 &lt;strong&gt;Learning and development &lt;/strong&gt;opportunities including an annual learning budget, access to self-paced learning platforms and language training, personalized coaching, mentorship, and leadership programs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍼 &lt;strong&gt;Family Leave Plus&lt;/strong&gt; gives you additional fully paid weeks of parental leave on top of government-provided leave, so you can spend more time with your new addition&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📈 &lt;strong&gt;Our equity participation program&lt;/strong&gt; allows you to share in our success&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information on our benefits, &lt;a href=&quot;https://commercetools.com/careers/our-benefits&quot;&gt;visit this page.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come as you are. Build with us.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your unique perspective is essential to our success. We are committed to building a team that reflects the world around us because we know it’s the only way to build the future. We celebrate our differences and have created a hiring process that’s fair, inclusive, and designed to let your talent shine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We proudly welcome applicants of every race, color, religion, gender identity, sexual orientation, age, and any other part of your identity that makes you who you are. As an equal opportunity employer, we believe that our strength lies in our diversity, and we invite you to be a part of our global community.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information on our diversity, equity, inclusion, and belonging practices, &lt;a href=&quot;https://commercetools.com/careers/dei-esg&quot;&gt;visit this page&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BOUT TIDE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we help SMEs save time and money in the running of their businesses by not only offering business accounts and related banking services, but also a comprehensive set of highly usable and connected administrative solutions, from invoicing to accounting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tide is transforming the small business banking market and now supports over 2 million members globally across the UK, India, Germany and France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Using advanced technology, all solutions are designed with SMEs in mind. With quick onboarding, low fees and innovative features, we thrive on making data driven decisions to serve our mission: to help SMEs save time and money so they can get back to doing what they love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tide facts:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tide is available for UK, Indian, German and French SMEs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 2 million members globally and rapidly growing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over $300 million raised in funding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3,000 Tideans globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognised with Great Place to Work certification three years in a row, and among India’s Top 50 Best Workplaces in Banking, Financial Services, and Insurance in 2026&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have offices in Central London, with a member support and technology centre in Sofia, Bulgaria, technology centres in Serbia, Romania, Lithuania and Hyderabad and offices in Gurugram, New Delhi, Berlin, Paris and Luxembourg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are an experienced Product Leader—strategic, analytical, and customer-focused with strong problem solving skills and a commercial mindset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own Membership Plans and the wider Subscriptions platform across multiple markets, shaping how we structure, price, and deliver value to our members as Tide scales. This role is central to defining the future of our subscription offering, ensuring it is flexible, competitive, and aligned to member needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with cross-functional teams, you will optimise the end-to-end subscription experience. This includes defining and refining membership tiers, benefits, and pricing models, while ensuring seamless lifecycle management—from sign-up and upgrades through to renewals, downgrades, and cancellations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join the Member Engagement Marketing (MEM) product group, responsible for driving engagement, retention, and long-term member value. Membership Plans sit at the heart of this mission, ensuring members clearly understand and experience the value of their Tide membership. You will collaborate closely with Billing, Payments, Marketing, Data, Finance, Engineering, and Design to deliver a frictionless, transparent, and engaging subscription journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Head of Product for Membership Plans, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the strategy, vision, and roadmap for our global Membership Plans, delivering a high-quality, scalable member experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, evolve, and optimise subscription tiers, benefits, and pricing, using customer insight and data to drive impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end product delivery, from discovery through execution, across the full subscription lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally to deliver measurable business outcomes, aligned to company OKRs and growth priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion best-in-class user experience, ensuring clarity, transparency, and consistency across all membership touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and support Product Managers as the team scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage qualitative and quantitative insights to improve retention and long-term member value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;WHAT WE ARE LOOKING FOR:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of product management experience, with proven ownership of subscription, membership, or product-led growth initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and commercial capability, with experience defining KPIs/OKRs and driving revenue- and retention-focused outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent cross-functional leadership, with the ability to influence senior stakeholders across technical and commercial teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer-first, outcome-driven mindset, focused on delivering meaningful, high-impact member experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating in ambiguous, fast-scaling environments, translating complexity into clear priorities and execution plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, confident communicator, able to articulate product vision and trade-offs to diverse audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building scalable, global products, with awareness of local market and regulatory considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;WHAT YOU’LL GET IN RETURN:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our location-specific employee benefits are designed to cater to the unique needs of Tideans:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Compensation -&amp;nbsp; Competitive salary and share options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time Off – Generous annual leave on top of bank holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental Leave – Paid maternity, paternity, and adoption leave to support your family journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sabbatical – Extended unpaid and paid leave options after completing milestone years with Tide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to salary sacrifice benefits – like Nursery (could save up to 47% on fees!) and Cycle to Work discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Insurance – Comprehensive Private family insurance plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life &amp;amp; Accident Cover – Comprehensive accidental and life insurance protection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Wellbeing – Access to therapy sessions, courses, meditations, and workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement Planning – Build your retirement fund faster with Tide’s pension scheme on eligible earnings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteering &amp;amp; Development Days – Paid days annually for volunteering or personal growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development – Annual budget for books, courses, coaching, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;WOO (Work Outside the Office) – Work from abroad for up to 90 days annually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Setup – Contribution towards setting up your home office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Laptop Ownership – Keep your old laptop and get a new one when it’s time for a replacement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Snacks &amp;amp; Meals – Daily breakfast spread with all-day coffee, tea, and juices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;TIDEAN WAYS OF WORKING&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we champion a &lt;strong&gt;flexible workplace &lt;/strong&gt;model that&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;supports both in-person and remote work to cater to the specific needs of our different teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While remote work is supported, we believe in the power of face-to-face interactions to foster team spirit and collaboration. Our offices are designed as hubs for innovation and team-building, where we encourage regular in-person gatherings to foster a strong sense of community.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;TIDE IS A PLACE FOR EVERYONE&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we believe that we can only succeed if we let our differences enrich our culture. Our Tideans come from a variety of backgrounds and experience levels. We consider everyone irrespective of their ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, veteran, neurodiversity or differently-abled status. We celebrate diversity in our workforce as a cornerstone of our success. Our commitment to a broad spectrum of ideas and backgrounds is what enables us to build products that resonate with our members’ diverse needs and lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are One Team and foster a transparent and inclusive environment, where everyone’s voice is heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Tide, we thrive on diversity, embracing various backgrounds and experiences. We welcome all individuals regardless of ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, or disability. Our inclusive culture is key to our success, helping us build products that meet our members&#39; diverse needs. We are One Team, committed to transparency and ensuring everyone’s voice is heard.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;It has come to our attention that individuals or agencies are falsely claiming to represent Tide and are reaching out to candidates regarding job opportunities. Please be aware that:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tide does&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;charge any fees at any stage of the recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;All official Tide job opportunities are listed exclusively on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tide.co/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Careers Page&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and applications should be submitted through this channel.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Communication from Tide will only come from an official&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;@tide&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;.co&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tide does not work with agencies or recruiters without prior formal engagement, and we do not authorize third parties to make job offers on our behalf.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you are contacted by anyone misrepresenting Tide or requesting payment, please treat it as fraudulent and report it to us immediately at &lt;a ----- ----- safety and trust are important to us, and we are committed to ensuring a fair and transparent recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Tide leverages AI to enhance our hiring experience. You can read more about how we use AI in our recruitment process in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/5MFtWSdG8YLKq3jZkK52NY/3f18633073e6cdbd03bba4b9791c64f4/Using_AI_throughout_the_Hiring_Process.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AI Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be processed by Tide for recruitment purposes and in accordance with &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/30JAUcDJMlaCwUKt4zoW0j/dd541981a67b6838d6e54537704bc8aa/Tide_Recruitment_Privacy_Notice_Job_Post_Version.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/1MYf6q4ZMWugpeaROVETBN/526e9c160a2de03576413c81657c6466/Recruitment_Privacy_Notice__Final_Draft__Sep_2024_.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Tide&#39;s Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Established in 2004, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;OLIVER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; is the world’s first and only specialist in designing, building, and running bespoke in-house agencies and marketing ecosystems for brands. We partner with over 300 clients in 40+ countries and counting. Our unique model drives creativity and efficiency, allowing us to deliver tailored solutions that resonate deeply with audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a part of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Brandtech Group&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, we&#39;re at the forefront of leveraging cutting-edge AI technology to revolutionise how we create and deliver work. Our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;AI solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; enhance efficiency, spark creativity, and drive insightful decision-making, empowering our teams to produce innovative and impactful results.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW148357319 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW148357319 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;Role: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW148357319 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW148357319 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;Director of Social &amp;amp; Creator – Dove Social Studios&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW148357319 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW148357319 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW148357319 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW148357319 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt; London (Global remit), 2–3 days per week &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;The Opportunity:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;role is on the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Dove Social Studio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;an&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt; always-on content &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt; social engine &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;spanning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt; 15 markets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;. It drives social-first excellence for one of the world’s most iconic, purposeful brands, connecting Dove’s values with audiences through culture, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;creativity&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt; community&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This is an opportunity to shape how Dove connects with millions of people globally &amp;amp; define best-in-class social for both the brand &amp;amp; the industry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;As Director of Social &amp;amp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Creators&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;, you will &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;set&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt; the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;global&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt; standard for how Dove shows up &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;on social &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;inspire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt; a multi-market team to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;continually &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;raise the bar.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sitting on the client Global Leadership Team, you&#39;ll define how one of the world&#39;s most iconic brands shows up on social — and lead the multi-market team that delivers it. You&#39;ll oversee social media managers, creator leads, and senior social experts across markets, building capability, setting standards, and driving a programme that is native to platform, culture, and audience. As the senior social adviser to the client&#39;s global team, you&#39;ll translate platform expertise into confident, clear strategic direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Social Platform Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define global social frameworks, standards, and best practice across client Social Studios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify platform opportunities, cultural moments, and emerging formats — and translate them into clear strategic action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the studio&#39;s social authority, championing platform-native thinking across creative and content output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creator &amp;amp; Influencer Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the client&#39;s end-to-end creator and influence programme — from strategy design through to delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve the programme in line with audience behaviour, platform developments, and brand values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee creator managers and a large UGC network, maintaining creative quality, brand alignment, and scalable delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate creator activity across markets and ensure consistent use of the Creator Bench&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Capability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a global, multi-disciplinary team of social media managers, creator managers, and senior social experts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear objectives and build a culture of curiosity, craft, and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach talent at all levels; create visible pathways for professional growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary social-craft partner to senior client stakeholders globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate platform expertise and audience insight into strategic counsel, platform reviews, and brand presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior stakeholders, operating credibly at global marketing director level and above&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content &amp;amp; Campaign Planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Put social insight, audience behaviour, and platform understanding at the centre of content and campaign planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set community management standards that consistently reflect the client&#39;s voice, values, and purpose&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Budget Accountability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee studio-level and creator programme budgets; present financial performance to client and OLIVER senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive cost-effective delivery across a multi-market creator ecosystem — balancing quality, scale, and commercial health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable for the financial health of the social and creator discipline within the studio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
