&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Principal Medical Writer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our &lt;strong&gt;Principals&lt;/strong&gt; play a fundamental role in shaping individual projects within an account with the support and direction of others. They co-lead the creation of outstanding medical content across various therapy areas and provide strategic insights to elevate client deliverables. This position is ideal for a proactive communicator who enjoys managing writing teams, ensuring quality and accuracy, and acting as a primary contact for clients. Our Principals have the opportunity to specialise in content development, team leadership, and/or strategic thinking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All Principals share the following core responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Therapy area and scientific expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Co-lead development of high-quality medical content under senior direction across multiple therapy areas and initiatives to meet/exceed client expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic thinking:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic input to aligned accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate confidence and competent in questioning to probe and understand client briefs and distill for Real Chemistry teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adopt a questioning mindset to scientifically and strategically challenge and elevate outputs with clients and internal teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI: &lt;/strong&gt;Co-lead implementation of AI into new projects and initiatives under senior direction within an account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client relationships:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as day-to-day medical contact for clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Managing and advising:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and mentor junior individuals and teams to work competently, confidently and efficiently to deliver high-quality work in high-pressure situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for guaranteeing the accuracy and quality of assets and that they are crafted and delivered in line with client objectives and expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delegate work within account to ensure everyone is hitting billable targets and learning through new opportunitiesThe Principal, Medical Content additionally has the following responsibilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Co-lead excellent medical content across a broad range of deliverables, demonstrating versatility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content excellence:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uphold and advocate for the highest standards in medical writing within accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify the most appropriate channel, style and format for a project to achieve client objectives and maximise engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality standards:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uphold the highest standards within accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for best practices in project management and delivery to maintain the highest content&amp;nbsp; quality within account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead development of knowledge training for junior members within account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Principal, Medical Team additionally has the following responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coaching and mentoring:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide coaching and mentorship to JMWs/MWS/SMWs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate specialised mentorship programs for JMWs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overarching planning to meet KPIs/timelines/budget: &lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and prioritise competing workloads within the account, fostering a comprehensive understanding of the team&#39;s projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for guaranteeing that assets are crafted and delivered in line with KPIs, timelines, and budget constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial and resource management&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and organise resource distribution within accounts to facilitate strategic succession planning and to optimise the alignment of medical colleagues&#39; skills and capacity with account requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in general financial oversight of the account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Medical Strategist additionally has the following responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business development:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support definition/shape of strategy on new business proposals and pitches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to identification of opportunities for organic growth through participating in key engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the shaping and execution of strategy for projects in collaboration with medical writing and client service teams and key strategic contact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as knowledge partner by confidently engaging with clients to exchange ideas, create options etc in conjunction with medical writing and accounts teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide input on how a scientific evidence-base can shape a brand’s go-to market strategy, positioning, evidence generation and medical communication strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Critical thinking: &lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify key actionable insights, recommendations, opportunities, threats, and critical success factors to inform product strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and structure meetings/workshops to support decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You should bring previous experience of medical writing at an SMW level or above&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience managing medical writers and interacting regularly with clients is essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A profound understanding of healthcare, science, medicine, and the pharmaceutical industry is essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high level of academic achievement is expected&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll need to be personable, articulate, and capable of nurturing relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What Real Chemistry offers&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry offers a comprehensive benefit program and perks. Learn more about our great benefits and perks at: http://www.realchemistry.com/&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry is proud to be Great Place to Work®&amp;nbsp;certified; check out what our people shared about our culture and workplace on our Great Places to Work Profile&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.greatplacetowork.com%2Fcertified-company%2F7038366&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cclehmar%40realchemistry.com%7C1f18aaed4326491b3efc08ddd690f025%7C6fa5bfc4f95843f8bb395d382689654b%7C0%7C0%7C638902640185888156%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=pwvaCn37QXkjVQ0p6u92Oz4FA4j5NQZoNJL0ffy01qs%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe we can do our best when feeling our best, which is why we’ve put together a benefits program designed to give you the support you and your family need at every stage of life. Real Chemistry offers a comprehensive benefit program and perks, tailored to your region. Globally, this includes offices in our key markets with free snacks to keep you running all day long, generous holiday and paid time off, options for private medical, dental, and vison plans, and support in saving for the future. Other perks include mental wellness coaching and support&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;access to more than 13,000 online classes with LinkedIn Learning.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Learn more about our great benefits and perks and search specific offerings in your region at:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.realchemistrybenefits.com&quot;&gt;www.realchemistrybenefits.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;At Real Chemistry, we believe we&#39;re at our best when we&#39;re connected. Our Real Hybrid and Regional Teams (Real HART) approach is designed to foster collaboration, learning, innovation, and meaningful relationships while providing flexibility where appropriate.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Because our workforce spans multiple countries, regions, and client needs, work arrangements may vary by role and location. Some positions offer hybrid or remote flexibility, while others require regular in-office presence. For example, certain teams and regions, including some of our UK operations, have office-based requirements. Your recruiter will discuss the specific expectations for the role you&#39;re pursuing during the interview process and keep you informed throughout the hiring journey.&amp;nbsp;For employees located within a one-hour commute of a Real Chemistry office, we require in-person attendance two days per week, either from a Real Chemistry office or when working onsite with clients. Employees in regions without a nearby office may work remotely and come together throughout the year for collaboration, culture-building, learning, and team connection opportunities.&amp;nbsp;While these guidelines reflect our current workplace model, we understand that everyone’s circumstances are unique. If you require additional flexibility, we welcome an open conversation with your recruiter and our HR team to discuss your needs and determine what may be possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry is an Equal Opportunity employer. We continually strive to build and sustain an inclusive and equitable work environment where our employees feel empowered to leverage all they bring from their personal lived experience and professional expertise, to make our team the best in the industry. We encourage motivated and qualified applicants to apply without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), sexual orientation, gender identity/expression, ethnic or national origin, age, physical or mental disability, genetic information, marital information, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local employment discrimination laws where Real Chemistry operates. Should you require accommodations throughout the interview process please let your recruiter know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Notice: Real Chemistry and its affiliates&#39; names are being misused by scammers through messaging services, fake websites, and apps. Do not share personal or financial information or make payments to any unverified sources claiming to be connected to Real Chemistry. We are working to stop these unauthorized activities and protect our community. Read more&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.realchemistry.com%2Fscam-alert&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cclehmar%40realchemistry.com%7C1f18aaed4326491b3efc08ddd690f025%7C6fa5bfc4f95843f8bb395d382689654b%7C0%7C0%7C638902640185967986%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=vBa1KYjD6TUHgTF3FdPRQZvM8E8WUgHZqu9yHevh1%2BI%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Services Senior Project Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;UK (Remote)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department:&lt;/strong&gt; Professional Services (PS)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rubrik Professional Services is looking for a high-energy, strategic, and results-driven Senior Project Manager to lead complex, enterprise customer implementations and help shape the future of our delivery practice. In this role, you will be customer-facing, acting as a trusted advisor to ensure deployment success, business value realisation, and operational efficiency. You will own high-stakes client engagements end-to-end, bringing deep project management expertise to solve problems on the ground and drive customer outcomes with minimal oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a Senior Project Manager in our PS Organisation, you will drive impact primarily through hands-on delivery excellence, leadership, and practice enablement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1. Client Delivery Excellence&lt;br&gt;● Drive Complex Engagements: Lead end-to-end delivery of complex, concurrent, enterprise-level&amp;nbsp;customer projects from kickoff to sign-off within fast-paced environments.&lt;br&gt;● Scope &amp;amp; Milestone Management: Prepare enterprise customers for deployment, establish clear&amp;nbsp;success criteria, track deliverables, set targets, manage resources, and ensure project execution&amp;nbsp;adheres to deadlines and budgets.&lt;br&gt;● Risk &amp;amp; Issue Governance: Proactively identify, track, and mitigate project risks and technical&amp;nbsp;dependencies, resolving issues autonomously before they escalate.&lt;br&gt;● Stakeholder Alignment: Serve as the single point of contact and escalation owner for customer&amp;nbsp;executives, cross-functional internal teams (Engineering, Customer Support, Sales), and third-&amp;nbsp;party partners.&lt;br&gt;● Quality &amp;amp; Performance: Execute quality control throughout project lifecycles to ensure deliverables meet or exceed Rubrik&#39;s standards and customer business objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2. PMO &amp;amp; Process Optimisation&lt;br&gt;● Partner with PS leadership to help build, refine, and maintain the PMO governance framework, including standard operating procedures, project methodologies, and key performance indicators.&lt;br&gt;● Continuous Improvement: Flag bottlenecks and recommend improvements that enhance&amp;nbsp;operational efficiency, margins, and customer satisfaction.&lt;br&gt;● Assist in establishing best practices for your engagements, resource allocation, utilisation tracking, and project health reporting across the PS portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;● 8+ years of direct Project Management experience delivering customer-facing, enterprise&amp;nbsp;technical projects within a Professional Services or Consulting organization.&lt;br&gt;● Previous experience with managing customers from Financial Services, Government, Healthcare&amp;nbsp;industries&lt;br&gt;● Track record of managing multiple complex, high-visibility client engagements concurrently in a&amp;nbsp;fast-paced technology environment.&lt;br&gt;● Demonstrated ability to work autonomously, exercising strong judgment and decision-making in&amp;nbsp;ambiguous, high-pressure customer situations.&lt;br&gt;● Expert knowledge of modern project management tools (e.g., Smartsheet, Jira, Confluence,&amp;nbsp;Asana) as well as Google Workspace.&lt;br&gt;● Fluent written and spoken English skill is a must.&lt;br&gt;● Exceptional executive communication, stakeholder management, negotiation, and conflict&amp;nbsp;resolution skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good to Have Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;● Recognised credentials like Project Management Professional (PMP), PRINCE2, knowledge of Agile/Scrum (CSM, PMI-ACP), or Lean frameworks.&lt;br&gt;● Technical Background: Prior hands-on experience or foundational knowledge in Data&amp;nbsp;Management, Cloud Infrastructure (AWS, Azure, GCP), Data Protection, Enterprise Storage,&amp;nbsp;Cybersecurity, or SaaS delivery is a strong plus.&lt;br&gt;● Financial acumen regarding professional services metrics (e.g., revenue recognition, margin,&amp;nbsp;utilization, project profitability).&lt;br&gt;● Additional European language skills (German, Spanish etc.) are a great plus.&lt;br&gt;● Experience contributing to PMO governance practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rubrik Professional Services transforms possibilities into outcomes. Our portfolio of services uncovers&amp;nbsp;and exploits the unique opportunities made possible by Rubrik technology. Drawing on our unparalleled&amp;nbsp;product expertise and customer experiences, we collaborate with customers to identify and address&amp;nbsp;complex technical challenges, improve operational efficiency, and maximize their investment in Rubrik.&amp;nbsp;We are 100% focused on customer success, operational excellence, and empowering our team members&amp;nbsp;to grow, lead, and innovate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (RBRK), the Security and AI Operations Company, leads at the intersection of data protection, cyber resilience, and enterprise AI acceleration. Rubrik Security Cloud delivers complete cyber resilience by securing, monitoring, and recovering data, identities, and workloads across clouds. Rubrik Agent Cloud accelerates trusted AI agent deployments at scale by monitoring and auditing agentic actions, enforcing real-time guardrails, fine-tuning for accuracy and undoing agentic mistakes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/&quot;&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/rubrikinc&quot;&gt;X (formerly Twitter)&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rubrik.com&quot;&gt;Rubrik.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion @ Rubrik&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong, and believe they can succeed. Our commitment to inclusion is at the heart of our mission to secure the world’s data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to hire and promote the best talent, regardless of background. We continually review our hiring practices to ensure fairness and strive to create an environment where every employee has equal access to opportunities for growth and excellence. We believe in empowering everyone to bring their authentic selves to work and achieve their fullest potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our inclusion strategy focuses on three core areas of our business and culture:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Company: We are committed to building a merit-based organization that offers equal access to growth and success for all employees globally. Your potential is limitless here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Culture: We strive to create an inclusive atmosphere where individuals from all backgrounds feel a strong sense of belonging, can thrive, and do their best work. Your contributions help us innovate and break boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Communities: We are dedicated to expanding our engagement with the communities we operate in, creating opportunities for underrepresented talent and driving greater innovation for our clients. Your impact extends beyond Rubrik, contributing to safer and stronger communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer/Veterans/Disabled&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, disability, genetic information, protected veteran status, or any other status protected by applicable law. Rubrik provides equal employment opportunities to employees and applicants in all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, promotion, compensation, training, leave, and termination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik provides reasonable accommodations to qualified applicants and employees with disabilities in accordance with applicable law. If you need an accommodation to participate in the application process or to perform your job, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a ----- ----- Accommodations may include changes to the application process, documents in an alternate format, a sign language interpreter, or specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO IS THE LAW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/olms/regs/compliance/eo_posters/employeerightsposter2page_19final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;NOTIFICATION OF EMPLOYEE RIGHTS UNDER FEDERAL LABOR LAWS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Why At Dotmatics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Dotmatics, a Siemens company,&amp;nbsp; we believe science, data, and decision-making must be deeply intertwined for innovation to thrive. Our Portfolio includes Luma, LumaLab Connect, ELN Platform, Graphpad Prism, Geneious, SnapGene, Protein Metrics, OMIQ, FCS Express, LabArchives, NQuery, EasyPanel, SoftGenetics and Virscidian.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We have a vision for a new Lab of the Future that will change the future of scientific research.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have created the world’s most comprehensive digital science platform – best-of-breed software applications already used by more than 2 million scientists, together in a single ecosystem united by a powerful, flexible enterprise data platform. This is not flat data buried away in digital graveyards. This is dynamic, multi-dimensional decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scientific enterprises need a new level of effectiveness to achieve tomorrow’s breakthroughs. Illness will not wait. The biosphere will not wait. We are tireless in our vision, because the time for innovation is now.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shaping the Future of Science At Dotmatics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our global team of more than 800 colleagues are dedicated to supporting our customers in over 180 countries. Together, with our scientific community of users, we accelerate scientific innovation in order to make the world a healthier, cleaner, and safer place to live.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join a collaborative, global team pushing the boundaries of scientific innovation.&amp;nbsp; Your ideas and efforts will have a tangible impact, accelerating scientific progress and discovery. We offer a dynamic, remote-friendly environment that fosters high integrity and collaboration, empowering you to excel. Dotmatics is a company built by scientists, for scientists. Combined, we are now the world’s largest cloud-based scientific research R&amp;amp;D platform. We need your help to keep growing and pioneering the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are Science Driven. We are Customer Centric. We are Better Together.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Text&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What do we need&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced market leader, thought leader and SME in Lab Automation and Orchestration.&lt;br&gt;Lab automation is where science meets engineering. Robotics, liquid handlers, instruments, and scheduling software are moving labs from manual work toward automated, data driven, and eventually autonomous operation. While we are supporting fully automated labs, most labs still run as islands. Instruments speak different languages, workflows are hard to change, and the data that comes off the line rarely arrives ready for analysis or AI.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building Luma, a Scientific Intelligence Platform for life sciences and materials science. Lab Orchestration and automation are core to our Molecule to Market story, and they connect directly to the strengths of Siemens in industrial automation. We need someone to own the market strategy for it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a customer and market facing role. You’ll spend real time with lab automation leaders at pharma, biotech, CDMOs, and research institutes across the UK and Europe, hearing what they need and bringing it back to the business. You’ll also support teams around the world across Siemens, including sales, product, services, customer success, and the Siemens Solution Marketing team, so everyone can speak to the lab automation market with confidence and one consistent story. You’ll work with industry thought leaders to shape the conversation on autonomous labs and AI. Your job is to drive software adoption and AI use cases in lab automation. You will shape where we play, who we sell to, how we position, and how we win.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll spend your time&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer engagements: meeting automation leaders, scientists, and engineers, joining pursuits, and bringing what you hear back to the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market analysis: sizing segments, tracking competitors and automation vendors, and spotting trends early&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales enablement: giving teams across regions the talk tracks, battlecards, demo narratives, and proof points to win&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution marketing: partnering with the Siemens Solution Marketing team on content, campaigns, events, and messaging for the lab automation audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thought leadership: working with industry thought leaders, inside and outside Siemens, to shape the conversation on self driving labs and the future of the automated lab&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adoption and AI use cases: identifying, proving, and spreading the use cases that get labs running on Luma and putting AI to work on automated workflows and data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner and ecosystem engagement: working with instrument makers, robotics providers, and integrators so our joint story is clear to customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross organization alignment: working across Siemens DISW and DI Automation teams so we show up as one company with one story for the lab automation market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The goal is simple. Drive excellence in how we represent ourselves to lab automation buyers, and turn that into real software adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the market strategy for Luma in lab automation, including workflow orchestration, scheduling, instrument integration, data capture, and autonomous lab concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define target segments, buyer personas, and priority accounts, including Heads of Lab Automation, Automation Engineers, Discovery Technologies, Research IT, Core Facilities, and Operations leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build positioning and messaging that speaks to automation engineers, scientists, IT leaders, and executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive software adoption by working with customers and field teams to find the workflows where Luma delivers value fastest, and by capturing what works so others can repeat it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and prove AI use cases for lab automation, including closed loop experimentation, smarter scheduling, and data prepared for tools like NVIDIA BioNeMo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate automation pain points into clear value, including less integration work, faster workflow changes, better use of instruments, trusted data, and a clear path from automation islands to connected labs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Siemens Solution Marketing team to build content, campaigns, and events for the lab automation market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with industry thought leaders, analysts, and partners to build credibility and bring outside voices into our story&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create the competitive view against other informatics vendors, scheduling and orchestration tools, automation vendors, and in house builds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the business case, pricing inputs, and value story with Finance and Sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equip global teams with talk tracks, battlecards, demo narratives, and customer proof points&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with DISW and DI Automation teams to align messaging, joint offers, and customer conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product on roadmap priorities based on what automation teams tell us&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect lab automation to the bigger Molecule to Market narrative, including ELN, Biologics, and Tech Transfer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support strategic pursuits and executive conversations with customers and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track market trends, including autonomous labs, AI driven discovery, robotics, and data standards, and turn them into action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are looking for people who have &lt;/strong&gt;10 or more years in life sciences, lab automation, or scientific technology, with hands on experience in a pharma, biotech, CDMO, research institute, or automation vendor setting.&amp;nbsp; You will bring Strong analytical skills, including sizing markets and building a business case excellent writing and presentation skills. Ideally holding a degree in life sciences, engineering, robotics, or a related field, with a Masters or PhD a plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The key skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of how automated labs work day to day, including liquid handling, robotics, instrument integration, workflow scheduling, and the data that flows from them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of how automation leaders make decisions, balance speed, cost, and flexibility, and work with scientists, IT, and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in product marketing, market strategy, product management, or commercial roles at a software, automation, informatics, or life sciences solutions company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with scheduling and orchestration software, LIMS, ELN, or lab data platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of driving software adoption, or of turning new technology such as AI into use cases customers actually adopt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to turn complex science and technology into clear, simple messaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working with senior leaders, industry experts, and customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work across a large, global, matrixed organisation and build trust with teams in different regions and business units&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Right to work in the UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience running or supporting a lab automation team or an automated lab build&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of industrial automation concepts and how they apply to the lab&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with lab data standards and open interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI, machine learning, or data platforms in a scientific setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships with industry thought leaders, analysts, automation vendors, or research institutes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across the UK and European life sciences community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear lab automation market strategy adopted by Sales, Product, Services, and Solution Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Messaging and sales tools that teams around the world actually use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One consistent story for lab automation across Dotmatics, DISW, and DI Automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growing software adoption and a library of proven AI use cases in lab automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry voices who help tell our story&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growing pipeline and wins tied to lab automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automation leaders who can say, in their own words, why Luma helps them connect their labs and move toward autonomous operation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Research shows us the&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.theatlantic.com/magazine/archive/2014/05/the-confidence-gap/359815/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.theatlantic.com/magazine/archive/2014/05/the-confidence-gap/359815/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;confidence gap&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;imposter syndrome can get in the way of meeting outstanding candidates, so please don’t hesitate to apply — we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree that Dotmatics may collect your personal data for recruiting, global organization planning, and related purposes. Dotmatics &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dotmatics.com/privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://legal.hubspot.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; explains what personal information we may process, where we may process your personal information, our purposes for processing your personal information, and the rights you can exercise over Dotmatics use of your personal information.&lt;span class=&quot;c-message__edited_label&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dotmatics is an equal opportunity employer. We are a welcoming place for everyone, and we do our best to make sure all people feel supported and connected at work.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Addepar is a global data and AI platform empowering investment professionals to turn complex financial information into actionable intelligence. Addepar unifies portfolio, market and client data in a total portfolio view and delivers AI-powered insights within investment and client workflows. More than 1,500 firms in 60 countries use Addepar to manage and advise on nearly $10 trillion in assets. Its open platform integrates with 650 software, data and consulting partners to power end-to-end investment operations across firms of all sizes and levels of complexity. Addepar supports clients worldwide with offices in New York City, Salt Lake City, São Paulo, London, Edinburgh, Geneva, Warsaw, Dubai, Pune and Singapore.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Applied AI team works embedded with Addepar&#39;s strategic clients to figure out where AI can change how they work and then build those capabilities from scratch. You&#39;ll spend time understanding a client&#39;s world, identify what&#39;s worth building, prototype it, prove it works, and then partner with core engineering teams to ship it as product for all customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Applied AI Engineer, you&#39;ll build agentic systems from idea through production. The work starts with understanding the problem well enough to know what to build, then moves fast through prototyping and iteration. You&#39;ll design agent behavior, wire up tool integrations, tune evaluations until the AI actually works in practice. You&#39;ll sit close to the people who use what you build, and that feedback loop is how both the product and your skills grow fast. The team is new. Your work shapes what we ship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role may require occasional work outside standard business hours to accommodate client time zones and up to 15% travel to client sites, including occasional overnight and multi-day engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build AI-powered agents and tools end-to-end: identify the problem with clients and domain experts, prototype quickly, evaluate rigorously, and ship to production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement LLM integrations including prompt engineering, function calling, structured outputs, and retrieval-augmented workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define evaluation criteria and build test harnesses for AI systems where correctness is ambiguous and domain-specific&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with clients to understand their workflows, validate AI behavior, and iterate toward production quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with core engineering teams to generalize client-specific work into product features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to shared AI infrastructure (agent frameworks, tool integrations, deployment pipelines)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and maintain production AI systems with attention to reliability, cost, and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive professional software engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional experience with Python (the team&#39;s primary language)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with LLM APIs (Claude, GPT, or similar) including function calling and structured outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with SQL for data exploration and building data-grounded AI workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI-assisted development tools (Claude Code, Codex, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve built something from zero to one. You&#39;re drawn to figuring out what to build, not just building what&#39;s specified.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bias for action. You ship quickly, learn from feedback, and iterate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You see projects through from prototype to production and care about what the client experiences, not what the code does&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS/MS in Computer Science, Mathematics, or another quantitative field, or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building agentic systems (multi-step tool use, agent orchestration, durable workflows)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with additional backend languages (Java is valuable in our environment)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with financial data (portfolios, transactions, securities, accounting)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to cloud infrastructure (AWS) and container-based deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with evaluation frameworks or methodologies for measuring AI system quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act Like an Owner - &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Think and operate with intention, purpose and care. Own outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Together - &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Collaborate to unlock the best solutions. Deliver lasting value.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion Our Clients - &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Exceed client expectations. Our clients’ success is our success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Innovation - &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Be bold and unconstrained in problem solving. Transform the industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embrace Learning - &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Engage our community to broaden our perspective. Bring a growth mindset.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In addition to our core values, Addepar is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We seek to bring together diverse ideas, experiences, skill sets, perspectives, backgrounds and identities to drive innovative solutions. We commit to promoting a welcoming environment where inclusion and belonging are held as a shared responsibility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We will ensure that individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, and to receive other benefits and privileges of employment. Please contact us to request accommodation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;PHISHING SCAM WARNING: Addepar is among several companies recently made aware of a phishing scam involving con artists posing as hiring managers recruiting via email, text and social media. The imposters are creating misleading email accounts, conducting remote “interviews,” and making fake job offers in order to collect personal and financial information from unsuspecting individuals. Please be aware that no job offers will be made from Addepar without a formal interview process. Additionally, Addepar will not ask you to purchase equipment or supplies as part of your onboarding process. If you have any questions, please reach out to &lt;a ----------Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Company Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;wysiwyg&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ecosio is a fast-growing, innovative service company and a leading provider of B2B integration, specialising in electronic data interchange (EDI), Web EDI and e-invoicing. ecosio is part of Vertex, Inc., a leading global provider of indirect tax solutions listed on Nasdaq (VERX).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our brand slogan is&amp;nbsp;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Connections That Work&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;as we believe strong connections are central to successful business relationships - both external and internal. At ecosio, we hire individuals from all backgrounds and are committed to creating an inclusive work environment. We are technology lovers, set the highest standards for our solutions, and put innovative ideas first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Job Description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;wysiwyg&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll connect with the role if you enjoy...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;developing an expert understanding of ecosio’s products and services&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;presenting and explaining EDI and E-Invoicing concepts for clients so that they understand the impacts of ecosio’s solutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;analysing the technical requirements of our customers and their ERP and IT landscapes to enable them to integrate with ecosio’s SaaS offering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;scoping and planning of B2B and E-Invoicing projects with our enterprise customers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;collaborating with account executives to address technical questions in tenders&lt;br&gt;acting as a sparring partner for addressing technical questions about our solutions raised by the Sales team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;working together with our product team on the realisation of new ERP connectors for ecosio&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;joining ecosio Webinars as a technical expert&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;wysiwyg&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To connect with ecosio it is important to have…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a profound technical understanding of EDI or e-invoicing and the involved protocols and standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;a profound understanding of order-to-cash and purchase-to-pay ERP processes, in conjunction with SAP ERP and SAP S/4HANA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German or Spanish language skills at a native / C2 level, fluent English skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;excellent listening and analytical skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Additional Information&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;wysiwyg&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By connecting with us you will experience...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our remote-first culture lets you work remotely from one of our designated countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours to suit your schedule and priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual personal development budget to invest in conferences, courses, or career coaching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office allowance to create a workspace that fits your needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular events and trips to connect, celebrate, and have fun with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workations of up to 90 days per year within the EU, combining travel and productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellbeing support, including mental health resources and employee assistance programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional country-specific benefits based on your location&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sounds like a connection that works? Then apply now and we will get in touch soon!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As part of our hiring process at ecosio, we conduct standard background checks. You can find more information about them by clicking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ecosio.com/en/background-check/&quot; data-cke-saved-href=&quot;https://ecosio.com/en/background-check/&quot;&gt;HERE&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to build Connections That Work by fostering a diverse and inclusive team. We are committed to making everyone feel valued and empowered to contribute their unique skills, experiences and perspectives. And now we want to connect with you&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mavericks Wanted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;When was the last time you achieved the impossible? If that thought feels overwhelming, you might want to pause here, but if it sparks excitement...read on&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In 2015, we pioneered a “moneyball for biotech” approach, pooling projects and promising early-stage research from academia together under one financial umbrella to reduce risk and unleash innovation. This model allows science and small teams of experts to lead the way. We build bridges to groundbreaking advancements in rare&amp;nbsp;disease, and&amp;nbsp;develop life-changing medicines for patients with unmet needs as fast as humanly possible. &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Together we define white space, push boundaries, and empower people to solve problems. If you&#39;re someone who defies convention, join us and work alongside some of the most respected minds in the industry. Together, we&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;ask&amp;nbsp;&quot;why not?&quot; and help reengineer the future of biopharma. At BridgeBio, we value curiosity and experimentation—including the ethical &amp;amp; thoughtful use of AI to improve clarity, speed, and quality of work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the Senior Director, Head of Market Access, EU West Region and work closely with Medical affairs, Market Access, Commercial locally and globally, to support BridgeBio’s mission of delivering transformative medicines to patients with genetic rare diseases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the value demonstration strategy for our products across the region, and translate it into effective patient access: design each product&#39;s evidence generation plan, drive it through to delivery, and align it with pricing and access strategy, starting in France, then extending to the other countries of the EU West region&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your main responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evidence generation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and lead natural history studies, cohorts, registries, and analyses of medico-administrative databases (SNDS, BNDMR/ BaMaRa, rare disease network registries)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead indirect comparisons in the context of single-arm trials and very small patient populations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop health economic models (cost-effectiveness, budget impact) for France, then for other markets in the region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design real-world data collection frameworks (PUT-RD / data collection protocols) that can be reused for reassessment and in other countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the scientific publication and communication plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Study management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft specifications, run tenders, and select vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Convene and lead external scientific advisory committees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Secure all required approvals (health data access, ethics committees, regulatory compliance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the administrative, contractual, and budgetary aspects of studies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and validate all deliverables (protocols, analysis plans, study reports, publications)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value communication and internal expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate study results into actionable clinical and economic arguments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive scientific dissemination (congresses, publications)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the internal reference point on epidemiology, health economics, and health data matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a network of research agencies, academics, and institutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value and access strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and own the value demonstration strategy for each product across the region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build economic value propositions and value dossiers and ensure their local adaptation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to pricing strategy and preparation for CEPS negotiations (e.g., positive externalities, budget impact)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate and build the economic modelling and CEESP dossier (early scientific advice, modelling, CEESP submission, technical exchange, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute the health-economic and RWE content of early access dossiers and submissions to the Transparency Committee, in coordination with the Market Access Director, with progressively increasing ownership of Benelux dossiers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate assessors&#39; objections and build responses ahead of submission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;French rare disease ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build working relationships with rare disease networks, reference and competence centres, patient associations, and learned societies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate collaborations with existing registries and cohorts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to documenting the patient journey and disease burden&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Function leadership and development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and arbitrate the region&#39;s HEOR and RWE budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure the function (methods, quality standards, vendor panel, review processes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit and manage future team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the region to global HEOR and Market Access teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The above list of tasks is not exhaustive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Where You’ll Work&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a France-based role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel within France, a priority country, is expected, as is travel to our international office in Zug, Switzerland, for team alignment and engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to other countries in the EU West region may also be required. Local team meetings and the designated office location in France are in the Paris area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Underlined SCXW398674 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW398674 BCX0&quot;&gt;Who You Are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW398674 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW398674 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;List-kOVW5V UnorderedList-nqKD7g&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ListItem-ncLgmg&quot;&gt;7–10 years of experience in HEOR, real-world evidence (RWE), or market access within industry, biotech, or specialized consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ListItem-ncLgmg&quot;&gt;Direct, hands-on experience completing French market access dossiers, including submissions to the Transparency Committee, early access applications, and CEESP assessments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ListItem-ncLgmg&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of observational studies, medico-administrative databases, health economic modeling, and indirect comparisons&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ListItem-ncLgmg&quot;&gt;Proven experience managing vendors and budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ListItem-ncLgmg&quot;&gt;Ability to influence without direct authority and collaborate with global, multidisciplinary teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ListItem-ncLgmg&quot;&gt;A background in pharmacy, medicine, epidemiology, health economics, or biostatistics, with a master’s or doctoral degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ListItem-ncLgmg&quot;&gt;Fluency in French and professional proficiency in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW398674 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strongly preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in rare or ultra-rare diseases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced defending a surrogate endpoint or biomarker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of French rare disease networks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Belgian, Dutch, or Central and Eastern European systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initial people management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in biotech or a fast-growing organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expected attributes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quickly operate independently, with a strong sense of ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritize across multiple geographies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critical thinking and methodological rigor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compelling communication in both French and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Directness and clarity in all exchanges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a global company, our comprehensive benefits may vary based on location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We have high expectations for our team members. We make sure those working hard for patients are rewarded and cared for in return.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
