&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Sword, we’re building AI to heal billions and unlock humanity’s full potential. In doing so, we’re pioneering AI Care, a fundamentally new approach to healthcare built for medical reasoning, safety, and real-time treatment, not generic technology applied after the fact. As both a clinical-centric frontier AI lab and an applied AI platform, Sword is reimagining how care is delivered at scale, removing traditional barriers like appointments, waiting rooms, and stigma so more people can access the care they need—and ultimately get back to lives lived in full.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since 2020, Sword has expanded across physical therapy, women’s health, cardiometabolic, and mental health, and is now moving beyond the session to a fully AI-native, 24/7 care program that brings physical activity, therapeutic exercise, psychotherapy, nutrition, and behavior change into one connected experience. More than 700,000 members across three continents have completed over 10 million AI sessions, helping 1,000+ enterprise clients avoid more than $1 billion in unnecessary healthcare costs. Backed by 42 clinical studies, 44+ patents, and more than $500 million raised from leading investors including Khosla Ventures, General Catalyst, and Founders Fund, Sword is defining a new standard for healthcare.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;AI&amp;nbsp;Proficiency at Sword&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI fluency is a core expectation at Sword. Every candidate is assessed against our three-level framework — be ready to share real examples of how AI is already part of how you work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Explorer (Level 1) — Uses AI daily to boost personal productivity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Builder (Level 2) — Creates workflows and tools that elevate the whole team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Integrator (Level 3) — Embeds AI into products and processes at scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every hire must demonstrate at least Level 1. The expected level will vary depending on the seniority of the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI Care Operations (previously Sword Intelligence), is Sword&#39;s AI care management division. We don&#39;t deliver a clinical program to members. We deploy AI Care Managers, trained on more than 14 million real care interactions, to run the operations of providers, payers and national health systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It started as an internal problem. On the way to freeing over a million people from pain, Sword hit the same wall every healthcare organization does: we didn&#39;t have enough hands to scale the care we needed to provide. Instead of hiring our way out, we built AI to do it, certified it for clinical use, and ran it in our own operations before offering it to anyone else.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today we sell two families of solutions:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Triage&lt;/strong&gt; — a certified Clinical Triage Line that guides every patient to the right care, 24/7, across voice and digital channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Care Orchestration&lt;/strong&gt; — care navigation, population health campaigns (screenings, vaccinations, medication adherence), surgery prehab and rehab, and readmission prevention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;ve announced a partnership with the Hellenic Ministry of Health to build an AI-powered front door for Greece&#39;s 10 million citizens, and we work with other national health systems, health plans and providers across the US and Europe. The US is now our biggest growth opportunity, and this role is central to capturing it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a Head of Go-to-Market for AI Care Operations in the US. The role sits at the intersection of product marketing, competitive intelligence and commercial enablement. It is one of the leadership roles on the AI Care Operations team, reporting to the General Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here&#39;s the opportunity. &quot;AI agents for healthcare&quot; is one of the most crowded categories in the market right now. Voice AI startups, EHR vendors, care management platforms and outsourcers all claim to automate care operations, and to a buyer they can sound alike. Very few of them have certified medical devices, national-scale partnerships, or AI proven on hundreds of thousands of their own members before it was sold to anyone else. We have all three. Your job is to make that difference unmistakable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own three things:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make our value impossible to miss.&lt;/strong&gt; Build the narrative, positioning and competitive differentiation that make it obvious why AI Care Operations is categorically better than AI point solutions, legacy nurse lines and call centers, and the care management platforms buyers already have. That means the core messaging architecture across Triage and Care Orchestration, positioning by buyer (health plan, health system, value-based care, employer, government), battle cards, ROI frameworks, and the demos and proof that move a skeptical COO or VP of Care Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make sure the commercial team can tell that story.&lt;/strong&gt; Sword&#39;s segment sales teams sell many solutions and can&#39;t be experts in all of them. When the health plan team is in front of a Medicare Advantage plan, or the employer team is pitching a front door for a self-insured population, they come to you to scope the workflows, walk the buyer through how the agents actually work, and answer the hard questions on safety, integration and ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find, surface and pursue the opportunities.&lt;/strong&gt; You will canvass the US and international markets systematically for the accounts, RFPs, procurements, contract renewals and budget signals that would otherwise go unnoticed: a health plan rebuilding its care management operation, a health system under readmission penalties, a state agency tendering a nurse line. You&#39;ll use AI tooling to do this faster and wider than a traditional GTM team could, then partner with the relevant segment leader to make sure each opportunity is pursued and won.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;AI proficiency at Sword&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI fluency is a core expectation at Sword, and every candidate is assessed against our three-level framework: Explorer (uses AI daily for personal productivity), Builder (creates workflows and tools that lift the whole team) and Integrator (embeds AI into products and processes at scale). This role requires Builder at minimum. Come ready with real examples.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core positioning, messaging house and narrative architecture for AI Care Operations and each of its solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The category story: why AI care management that does the work beats both headcount and AI tools that only assist the people doing it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive intelligence and battle cards across voice AI and agentic AI vendors, nurse line and call center outsourcers, and care management platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Buyer-facing materials: one-pagers, ROI and capacity calculators, demo scripts and recorded agent calls, case studies, RFP response library, sales decks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proof architecture: turning deployments into case studies and outcome metrics (contacts handled, cost per interaction, gap closure, time to care, readmissions) that a CFO will sign off on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution specialist team (direct reports), paired with segment sales reps across health plans, health systems, value-based care, employers and government&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales and customer success enablement: training, playbooks, discovery guides, certification on each solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market opportunity mapping and systematic canvassing across US segments, with a lighter watch on international tenders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Message consistency across Sword&#39;s commercial segments and geographies, including where AI Care Operations is sold as part of the broader AI Care platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Voice of the market into product: what buyers ask for, where we lose, and what competitors are shipping&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;We&#39;d love to see&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are currently at, or recently from, a Lead, Head, Director or VP-level GTM or product marketing role where you owned the full stack: launching products, positioning, competitive differentiation, sales enablement and market strategy. You&#39;ve built things that measurably changed how deals were won.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can sell something that isn&#39;t a product category yet. AI Care Operations is bought by operations leaders, not benefits leaders, and it competes with a budget line (headcount, outsourcing) as much as with other vendors. You know how to make the case that replacing work is different from adding a tool, and you can tell a clean story across several solutions without it sounding like a platform pitch that means nothing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You think in first principles. Faced with a new buyer, your instinct is to ask what operational problem they actually have, why our agents solve it better than more staff or another vendor, and what evidence would make a skeptical COO believe it. You don&#39;t reach for a template.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are genuinely AI-fluent, not performatively. You&#39;ve built your own workflows and loops with AI tools for market intelligence, opportunity canvassing and competitive research. You&#39;ll also be selling AI, so you need to understand how our agents work well enough to explain their limits honestly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You write well and think clearly. Your materials are the kind a VP of Care Management reads and thinks &quot;these people have run a care operation.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are close to the field. You&#39;ve sat in on deals, heard objections live, and changed your strategy because of what buyers said rather than what you assumed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in product marketing and/or GTM, with clear ownership of positioning and competitive strategy, and current or recent Lead, Head, Director or VP scope&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ownership of all three: product marketing and positioning, GTM strategy, and sales, field or revenue enablement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to operational buyers (COOs, VPs of operations or care management, contact center leaders) rather than only end users or benefits teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence of working cross-functionally with sales and customer success, not only corporate marketing, and of building competitive intelligence from scratch rather than inheriting it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in the US&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Strong signal backgrounds&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B2B healthcare software and AI companies with strong commercial engines selling to health systems and payers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical device and health technology companies that sell regulated, certified products into providers and payers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automation and AI companies whose products replace operational work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has positioned an AI or automation product that replaces labor, and built ROI cases a CFO accepted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has built competitive displacement narratives that demonstrably changed win rates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has used AI tooling to drive market canvassing and opportunity identification at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with multi-solution, multi-segment GTM, including public sector procurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How success is measured&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a quota-carrying role, but it is not a soft one. You&#39;ll be held to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualified pipeline sourced from your canvassing, by segment and pillar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive win rate, and win rate on deals where a solution specialist was involved&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bookings influenced across health plans, health systems, value-based care, employers and government&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales cycle length from first meeting to signed pilot or contract&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enablement adoption: how many reps can pitch, demo and handle objections on each pillar without help&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role can sit remotely and the compensation range will be adjusted to accurately reflect the country in which the candidate resides&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;*The range below reflects base, variable, and equity for this role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;This is a starting point, not a ceiling — once someone joins and proves they&#39;re outlier talent, we adjust quickly to make sure their compensation matches their impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Job titles may span more than one career level, so actual pay depends on skills, qualifications, experience, location, and market demand, among other factors. The range reflects base salary plus any variable, bonus, or sales incentives, and our estimate of the value of private company stock options where applicable. It&#39;s subject to change, and future stock value isn&#39;t guaranteed. Sword also offers additional benefits beyond total compensation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Total Compensation Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$145,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$330,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;sup&gt;Country-specific benefits may vary and will be detailed separately.&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;sup&gt;Sword Health complies with applicable Federal and State civil rights laws and does not discriminate on the basis of Age, Ancestry, Color, Citizenship, Gender, Gender expression, Gender identity, Gender information, Marital status, Medical condition, National origin, Physical or mental disability, Pregnancy, Race, Religion, Caste, Sexual orientation, and Veteran status.&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Staff Product Manager – E-Commerce Web Upper Funnel [Permanent - CDI] (f/m/d)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Paris or Lille, France&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Decathlon E-Commerce Web – Scope Upper Funnel&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the heart of Decathlon’s global digital ecosystem, our &lt;strong&gt;E-Commerce Web&lt;/strong&gt; team builds the online destination for millions of sports lovers worldwide. The &lt;strong&gt;Upper Funnel&lt;/strong&gt; scope is the front door of our digital experience: from landing on the homepage and navigating categories, to discovering products via search, AI-driven recommendations, conversational shopping, retail media placements, and inspiring content. Our mission is to seamlessly guide users from inspiration to intent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining this high-traffic Web Product organization means operating at massive scale where speed, discovery excellence, SEO, targeted monetization, and next-gen personalized user journeys drive our everyday business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Product Manager – Upper Funnel&lt;/strong&gt;, you will provide the strategic direction, functional architecture, and product leadership needed to scale and modernize the discovery and exploration experience across Decathlon&#39;s web platform. Operating with high autonomy, you will address complex challenges across search performance, catalog structuring, retail media integration, and emerging AI paradigm shifts like conversational interface models and agentic workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission centers on 4 strategic pillars:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Strategic Alignment, Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; Upper Funnel Vision&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Holistic Discovery &amp;amp; Engagement Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: Define and drive the strategic vision for upper funnel web touchpoints (Homepage, Category/Listing Pages, Search Engine, Navigation Taxonomy, Retail Media Ad Placements, Conversational Assistants, and Inspiration Hubs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner with global business directors, commercial/merchandising leads, SEO specialists, retail media monetization teams, and AI platform engineering leads to align executive leadership around major web platform shifts and discovery roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Macro Metrics &amp;amp; Funnel Performance&lt;/strong&gt;: Track, measure, and optimize key upper funnel metrics across the customer journey: Organic/Direct Traffic, Search CTR, Category Depth, Conversational Engagement &amp;amp; Intent Resolution Rate, Ad Yield/eCPM, Bounce Rate, Product Detail Page (PDP) Click-through Rate, and Top-of-Funnel Conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Functional Architecture &amp;amp; Web Ecosystem Orchestration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Functional Architect&lt;/strong&gt;: Define boundary maps and functional scope across web squads (Search &amp;amp; Conversational Discovery, Taxonomy &amp;amp; Merchandising, Personalization/Recommendations, Retail Media &amp;amp; Sponsored Listings) to eliminate overlap and friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tight Triad Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: Work in close sync with Staff/Principal Web Engineers and Staff UX/UI Designers to align frontend performance (Core Web Vitals), modular web design systems, micro-frontend architecture, conversational UI patterns, and backend search/ad-serving APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seamless Omnichannel &amp;amp; Funnel Handoff&lt;/strong&gt;: Ensure fluid transitions from external acquisition channels into the web upper funnel, balancing organic product discovery and agentic assistance with sponsored/retail media inventory while designing seamless handoffs toward the lower funnel (PDP, Cart &amp;amp; Checkout).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Strategic Sparring &amp;amp; Product De-Risking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trusted Strategic Advisor&lt;/strong&gt;: Serve as a sparring partner for Group Product Managers (GPMs) and Product Managers (PMs) within the Web &amp;amp; E-Commerce domain, helping them navigate complex search algorithms, LLM agent architectures, ad server integrations, taxonomy dependencies, and high-volume web constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;De-Risking High-Stakes Initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;: Formulate and execute validation strategies for high-risk discovery and monetization concepts (e.g., visual/voice search, conversational product advisors, agentic auto-replenishment/bundles, sponsored product placements).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Experimentation at Scale&lt;/strong&gt;: Design and lead high-volume A/B and multivariate testing strategies, balancing conversational interaction models and ad impression density against organic conversion performance using CRO frameworks and Opportunity Solution Trees (OST).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Elevating Product Craft &amp;amp; Modern Web Capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-First, Agentic &amp;amp; Monetization Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: Champion the organizational adoption of cloud-native AI platforms (e.g., Google Vertex AI), conversational frameworks, agentic e-commerce patterns, and modern retail media capabilities to amplify both user experience and platform revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Web Craft &amp;amp; Best Practices&lt;/strong&gt;: Upskill the PM community in modern web product practices, continuous discovery frameworks, technical web performance optimization, and data-informed decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Community Multiplier&lt;/strong&gt;: Elevate the overall bar of the Product Management organization as a thought leader without acting as a direct line manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO THE TABLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;E-Commerce Web Scale (7+ years)&lt;/strong&gt;: Proven track record in Product Management with hands-on experience scaling high-traffic e-commerce web platforms (Upper Funnel, Search, Merchandising, or Navigation).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Upper Funnel &amp;amp; SEO Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;: Deep understanding of top-of-funnel mechanics, technical SEO, site search algorithms, taxonomy design, and conversion rate optimization (CRO).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Discovery Mastery&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong expertise in web analytics (GA4/Amplitude/Contentsquare), high-traffic A/B testing frameworks, quantitative/qualitative user research, and Opportunity Solution Trees (OST).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Functional Architecture &amp;amp; Scoping&lt;/strong&gt;: Ability to decompose complex e-commerce catalog, ad-tech, and AI/search problems into modular MVP/V0/V1 execution strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Storytelling &amp;amp; Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;: Exceptional ability to translate complex search/agentic architectures, retail media revenue drivers, UX metrics, and conversion data into compelling narratives for executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Pluses &amp;amp; Emerging Tech Strengths&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Google Vertex AI&lt;/strong&gt;: Practical experience using Google Vertex AI (for Search, Recommendations, or custom ML/LLM model deployment) is a major plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conversational &amp;amp; Agentic E-Commerce&lt;/strong&gt;: Solid understanding or experience with conversational AI interfaces (chat/voice product advisors) and agentic commerce concepts (autonomous intent-matching, task-oriented AI agents) is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retail Media &amp;amp; Monetization&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience with Retail Media concepts and ad management (sponsored products, ad-server integrations, balancing yield vs. UX) is a major plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills &amp;amp; Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong strategic influence, ability to thrive in ambiguity, passion for cross-functional collaboration in Triad, and an empathetic approach to mentoring junior PMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Work Model&lt;/strong&gt; (Paris or Lille base) 2 days of remote work per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tailored Equipment&lt;/strong&gt; (Mac or Windows, according to mission and sustainability commitments);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Exposure&lt;/strong&gt;: Local project team within a global retail and digital network with international career opportunities;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: Internal/external trainings, skill development programs, and conference attendance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;: Competitive salary package including employee stock ownership, profit-sharing, and monthly/quarterly performance bonuses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CSQ128R8&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Forward Deployed Engineer (FDE) you will work with customers to build and productionize solutions to their data &amp;amp; AI challenges using the Databricks platform. You will own the architecture, lead design decisions, and implement end-to-end systems spanning data engineering, AI, and application development. We work cross-functionally to shape long-term strategic priorities and initiatives alongside engineering, product, and developer relations. FDEs deliver with customer empathy, integrating with client systems, training, and other technical needs to help customers get most value out of their data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, customer-facing role for builders who thrive at the intersection of technology and business impact. The ideal candidate combines engineering expertise with adaptability, curiosity, and a passion for working with customers and teammates to solve complex problems that drive measurable outcomes. FDEs are billable and know how to complete projects according to specification with exceptional customer empathy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production Solution Delivery: Lead impactful customer technical projects by delivering production-grade systems, designing and building reference architectures, custom applications and data ingestion and ML/AI model integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transformational Impact: Guide strategic customers as they implement transformational big data projects including end-to-end design, build and deployment of industry-leading big data and AI applications. Work with engagement managers to scope technical delivery work with input from the customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empower Customers: Guide customers on architecture and design; bootstrap or implement customer projects which leads to a customers&#39; successful understanding, evaluation and adoption of Databricks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Architecture: Lead architecture and design decisions, ensuring solutions are secure, scalable, and aligned with both customer needs and Databricks best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Databricks technical team, Project Manager, Architect and Customer team to ensure the technical components of the engagement are delivered to meet customer&#39;s needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Engineering and Databricks Customer Support to provide product and implementation feedback and to guide rapid resolution for engagement specific product and support issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Immersion: Embed with customer teams, engaging with stakeholders from technical ICs to executives to deeply understand challenges and deliver impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reusable Assets &amp;amp; Scale: Contribute accelerators, frameworks, and best practices that scale impact across accounts and influence the Databricks product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What we look for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years experience in data engineering, data platforms &amp;amp; analytics, or software engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable writing code in either Python, Scala, JavaScript/TypeScript, and modern frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of two or more common Cloud ecosystems (AWS, Azure, GCP) with expertise in at least one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with distributed computing with Apache Spark™ and knowledge of Spark runtime internals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD for production deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of MLOps, ML/AI models and AI APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deployment of performant production end-to-end data architectures and applications that combine data pipelines, ML/AI models, and user-facing interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with technical project delivery - managing scope, timelines and measurable outcomes, translating complex concepts into actionable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documentation and white-boarding skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with enterprise clients and managing conflicts across a broad stakeholder range&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build skills in technical areas, and demonstrate curiosity, adaptability, and eagerness to explore new technologies which support the deployment and integration of Databricks-based solutions to complete customer projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to customers 20% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks Certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Unframe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unframe is an AI-first startup helping the world’s largest enterprises bring LLM-powered applications to life in days - not months. We combine the speed of a product company with the flexibility of a consultancy, helping customers move from idea to deployed AI systems faster than anyone else in the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by Bessemer, Craft, and TLV Partners with $100M in Series B funding, we’re building a fast-growing, revenue-generating company working with Fortune 500 customers globally&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits on the front line: you engage directly with enterprise clients, lead discovery to uncover core business challenges, and design and ship tailored AI solutions built on Unframe&#39;s platform. You own the work end-to-end, serving as the strategic and technical bridge from initial conversation through to final deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a true builder role. You write the precise specifications and prompt architectures that bring solutions to life, making the critical design decisions that determine whether an enterprise AI deployment actually succeeds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a project-led role with unmediated access to clients at every stage. You will typically manage several engagements simultaneously, with short planning horizons and evolving requirements. Roughly 30 to 40 percent of the role is active client management, ensuring senior stakeholders remain aligned through delivery, progress reviews, and post-deployment rollouts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Enterprise Discovery: &lt;/strong&gt;Conduct discovery sessions directly with enterprise clients to map workflows, uncover business challenges, and distinguish surface-level requests from fundamental operational needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design &amp;amp; Spec AI Solutions: &lt;/strong&gt;Translate customer problems into structured solution plans on Unframe&#39;s platform. Write detailed specs and define prompt and context structures, owning the complete solution design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive End-to-End Delivery: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with engineers and AI specialists to deliver solutions on target. Prioritize requirements and manage tradeoffs across speed, stability, and scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Represent the User &amp;amp; Platform: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as the voice of enterprise operators and domain experts while collaborating with the Platform team to identify reusable product patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in product management or technical delivery roles, with a proven track record working alongside engineering teams on complex, fast-paced technical products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Bilingual Fluency (English &amp;amp; French):&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent in French to connect with users and stakeholders in France, and fluent in English for daily collaboration across our international teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-Led Discovery: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven experience personally leading consultative conversations with enterprise buyers and operators - not supporting a sales call, not interviewing platform users, but owning the conversation to surface unstated needs and translate them into clear solution scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Stakeholder Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Ability to manage senior client relationships through a complex delivery; keeping stakeholders aligned, navigating competing priorities, and being the primary point of contact when requirements shift or timelines compress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem-to-Solution Design: &lt;/strong&gt;Ability to start from a raw business problem without existing features for reference, defining exactly how an AI solution should function and writing precise specs for build teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Complex Delivery Execution: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience shipping AI-powered features under tight timelines, managing evolving requirements, and documenting strategic tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Solutions Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Direct exposure to building with LLMs - writing prompt structures, defining context and output constraints, working with agentic systems, or managing model uncertainty in a shipped product or working prototype. This is the dimension most learnable on the job; concrete work product carries more weight than certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder Orientation: &lt;/strong&gt;Driven by creating customer-facing solutions rather than simply managing traditional roadmaps or processing requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Competencies: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong written communication, systems thinking, high attention to detail, fluent English (written and verbal), and the ability to navigate multi-faceted projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Remote (France):&lt;/strong&gt; This position is 100% remote within France.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Why join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;At Unframe, you’ll help build AI systems that are already delivering real value to global enterprises - not prototypes, demos, or side projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;You’ll work with exceptional teammates, collaborate directly with top-tier customers, and have real influence over both the solutions we ship and the evolution of our platform. This is a hands-on, high-impact role where product thinking, technical depth, and creativity come together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;If you enjoy solving hard problems, moving fast, and building practical AI products that actually make it to production - we’d love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineering Intern - Fullstack (x/f/m)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set a new pulse for healthcare!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Software Engineering Intern&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong&gt;Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission will be to build innovative products and features that improve the daily lives of care teams and patients. You will work in a feature team developing solutions that directly impact healthcare professionals and patients across Europe, contributing to our Operating System powered by AI to manage all clinical and administrative activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working in the tech team at Doctolib means building innovative products and features to improve the daily lives of care teams and patients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and own features alongside experienced engineers — from design and development to testing and shipping — with a direct impact on real users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineers, product managers, and designers to solve complex technical challenges and build scalable, secure, and user-friendly healthcare tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, efficient code following industry best practices in design, testing, and peer review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve real-world problems that directly enhance patient care and improve doctor-patient relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore new tools and technologies, including AI and distributed systems, as part of your continuous growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a culture of learning and collaboration by sharing knowledge and engaging actively with your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before you read on: if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love problem-solving and are driven by curiosity — you&#39;re not afraid to dive into complex issues and find creative solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in a collaborative environment and enjoy working with cross-functional teams, sharing knowledge, and learning from your peers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a passion for technology and product development, and always keep the user experience in mind&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable coding, with the help of AI agents like Claude Code, in multiple languages and eager to learn our tech stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are in your final year of a degree in Software Engineering, Computer Science, or a related field and looking for a 6-month full-time internship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eager to learn and work in a team of builders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It would be fantastic if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with web development or building products in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked on side projects or contributed to open-source communities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are familiar with AI-assisted coding tools and eager to integrate them into your daily workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Doctolib Tech&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our solutions are built on a single fully cloud-native platform that supports web and mobile app interfaces, multiple languages, and is adapted to country and healthcare specialty requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our stack is composed of Rails, TypeScript, Java, Python, Kotlin, Swift, and React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We leverage AI ethically across our products to empower patients and health professionals. Discover our AI vision &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to learn more about our tech culture and environment? Visit the&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Doctolib Tech site&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech masterclasses throughout the internship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free breakfast at the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the best AI tools for coding and development, along with dedicated training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discounted membership to Urban Sports Club&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal vouchers worth €8.50 per day, with €4.50 covered by Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;50% reimbursement of public transportation subscriptions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health insurance, fully covered by Doctolib for employees and their children under the basic plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free mental health and personalised coaching programme with our partner, &lt;a href=&quot;http://moka.care/&quot;&gt;Moka.care&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A comprehensive three-month onboarding programme, including Doctolib Academy and various training courses in languages, soft skills, and technical skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A works council subsidy providing partial reimbursement for sports or leisure activity memberships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For employees with disabilities or caregiving responsibilities, a support package including adapted remote-working arrangements, paid authorised leave for medical appointments, and enhanced psychological support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coding Game (1h)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter Interview (30 minutes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feature Building Interview (1h)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Behavioral Interview (1h)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internship (6 months)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paris (Levallois)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work setup (up to 2 remote days per week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start date: March 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We welcome everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the more our product will truly improve healthcare for all. You are welcome to apply to Doctolib, regardless of your gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure equal opportunities, we invite you to exclude personal information (e.g., pictures, age) from your applications. If you require any accommodation, please let us know for support during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your data privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All information provided is processed by Doctolib for application management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For data processing details, click here:&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-DE&quot;&gt; Germany&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-FR&quot;&gt; France&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-IT&quot;&gt; Italy&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-COM&quot;&gt; Netherlands&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please contact hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com for inquiries or to exercise your rights.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Senior Data Engineer into our engineering &lt;/strong&gt;team at Doctolib.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Your mission will be to build data products that provide insights and support decision-making across Doctolib, helping to transform access to healthcare. You will work in a feature team developing data pipelines and solutions that empower our organization with data-driven insights while supporting our AI strategy, enabling health professionals to deliver better care and helping millions of patients access quality healthcare.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Working in the tech team at Doctolib means building innovative products and features to improve the daily lives of care teams and patients.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Build and maintain data pipelines using Python (Dagster) to support Doctolib&#39;s AI strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain data marts in BigQuery using SQL/Jinja, DBT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Create dashboards for high-level reporting using Tableau&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Collaborate with stakeholders to understand their data needs and define specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Ensure data quality, security (GDPR compliance), and availability through monitoring and optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Before you read on: if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have at least 7+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of experience as a Data Engineer, or a similar role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have a first experience using code assistant (Claude, Cursor)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You are proficient in Python, SQL, and DBT for building data pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have experience with BI tools such as Tableau, Metabase, or similar platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have first experience with Google Cloud Platform (GCP) stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have a good understanding of functional aspects of data (Sales, Finance, Web Analytics, Product)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You have strong communication skills and can collaborate effectively with business teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;You are fluent in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;It would be fantastic if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have experience with AI products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have experience with Vertex AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Are familiar with GDPR regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Life at Doctolib Tech&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Our solutions are built on a single fully cloud-native platform that supports web and mobile app interfaces, multiple languages, and is adapted to country and healthcare specialty requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Our stack is composed of Rails, TypeScript, Java, Python, Kotlin, Swift, and React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;We leverage AI ethically across our products to empower patients and health professionals. Discover our AI vision&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to learn more about our tech culture and environment? Visit the&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Doctolib Tech site&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Free comprehensive health insurance (basic package) for you and your children&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;25 days of paid vacation per year, plus up to 14 days of RTT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Free mental health and coaching services through our partner Moka.care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Work from abroad for up to 10 days per year thanks to our flexibility days policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Lunch vouchers (Swile card) worth €8.50 per working day, with €4.50 covered by Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;A subsidy from the work council to refund part of the membership to a sport club or a creative class&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;50% reimbursement of your public transport subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Parent Care Program: receive one additional month of leave on top of the legal parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Enrollment in Doctolib&#39;s long-term employee value sharing plan called DoctoGrowth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;For caregivers and workers with disabilities, a package including an adaptation of the remote policy, extra days off for medical reasons, and psychological support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Relocation support in case of international mobility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Access to the best AI tools for coding, development and dedicated training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Our interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Recruiter Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Coding Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;System Design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Behavioral interview &amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;Meeting with the team at the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;At least one reference check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;We want your experience to be clear, respectful, and transparent. Learn more about our hiring process on our &lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/getting-hired/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;candidate experience page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Job details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Permanent position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Tech stack: Python, SQL, DBT, BigQuery, Tableau, Dagster&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Full-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Paris&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Hybrid work setup (up to 2 remote days per week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Start date: as soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;We welcome everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the more our product will truly improve healthcare for all. You are welcome to apply to Doctolib, regardless of your gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, or disability.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;To ensure equal opportunities, we invite you to exclude personal information (e.g., pictures, age) from your applications. If you require any accommodation, please let us know for support during the hiring process.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;Your data privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;All information provided is processed by Doctolib for application management. For data processing details, click here:&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-DE&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Germany&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;l&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-FR&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;France&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;l&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-IT&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Italy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;em&gt;l&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;s-break-all s-font-semibold s-transition-all s-duration-200 s-ease-in-out hover:s-underline s-text-highlight dark:s-text-highlight-night hover:s-text-highlight-400 dark:hover:s-text-highlight-400-night active:s-text-highlight-dark dark:active:s-text-highlight-dark-night&quot; href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-COM&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Netherlands&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Please contact hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com for inquiries or to exercise your rights.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;Join a team of passionate and committed people working to improve healthcare.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Doctolib, our tech teams build products and features that improve the daily lives of healthcare professionals and patients. We work in feature teams within an agile environment, in close collaboration with Product, Design, Data Science, and Business teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;AI Engineer Intern&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Tech team and contribute to the development of AI-powered features at Doctolib.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with experienced AI and software engineers to explore, prototype, evaluate, and improve AI-based solutions. This internship will give you the opportunity to gain practical experience across the different stages of an AI product, from experimentation to integration into a production environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development of AI features and services under the guidance of experienced engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write Python code to support prototypes, experiments, evaluation tools, and backend components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiment with large language models, prompting techniques, retrieval, and tool integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to automated tests and documentation for the components you develop&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate issues, analyse results, and suggest improvements to your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in code reviews, technical discussions, and team rituals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will receive regular guidance from your mentor and teammates. The scope of your work will grow progressively as you become familiar with the codebase, the tools, and the technical challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before you read on, if you do not have the exact profile described below but feel that this internship matches your skills and interests, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be a great fit if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are in the final year of a degree in Computer Science, Artificial Intelligence, Software Engineering, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have basic experience with Python through coursework, personal projects, research, or previous internships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a basic understanding of programming concepts, data structures, and software development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are curious about artificial intelligence and interested in understanding how AI systems work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable communicating in English, both written and spoken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It would be fantastic if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked on a project involving machine learning, natural language processing, or large language models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have used agentic frameworks like Langchain or Google ADK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experimented with AI APIs, prompting, retrieval, or conversational interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience in taking products to production and supporting them with real users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have some experience with Git, APIs, testing, or data analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an interest in healthcare, privacy, or responsible AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Doctolib Tech&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our products are built on a cloud-native platform that supports web and mobile applications across several countries and healthcare systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Even if Doctolib uses technologies like Ruby on Rails, TypeScript, Java, Kotlin, Swift, React Native, and many cloud-related technologies, the principal language you&#39;ll work on is Python.You will also have the opportunity to use AI-assisted development tools within our engineering practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discover our AI vision&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt; and learn more about our tech culture on the&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/&quot;&gt; Doctolib Tech site&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured internship with dedicated mentoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to work on real AI projects in a healthcare environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical learning sessions and access to internal engineering communities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to AI tools for coding, development, and learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal vouchers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free breakfast in the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 2 days of remote work per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible workplace policy, depending on the team and location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative and international working environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coding Game&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Behavioral Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internship, 6 months, full-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Berlin, Paris, Nantes, Milan, or Amsterdam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work setup, up to 2 remote days per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start date: March 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We welcome everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. We evaluate candidates based on their qualifications, motivation, and potential, without discrimination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the better our products can serve patients and healthcare professionals. We welcome applications regardless of gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, disability, or place of origin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To support an inclusive recruitment process, we invite you to leave personal information such as pictures and age off your application. If you require an accommodation during the interview process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your data privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All information provided through this application is processed by Doctolib for recruitment purposes. For more information about how Doctolib processes your application data, please consult the relevant privacy policy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-DE&quot;&gt;Germany&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-FR&quot;&gt;France&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-IT&quot;&gt;Italy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-COM&quot;&gt;The Netherlands&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For questions or to exercise your rights, please contact hr.dataprivacy(at)&lt;a href=&quot;http://doctolib.com/&quot;&gt;doctolib.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div data-page-number=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;react-pdf__Page shadow-md&quot; data-page-number=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;react-pdf__Page__textContent textLayer selecting&quot; data-main-rotation=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos missions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;react-pdf__Page__annotations annotationLayer&quot; data-main-rotation=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;Notre équipe Finance SSC (Shared Service Center) réinvente la comptabilité chez Doctolib. Là où la plupart des entreprises commencent à peine à mentionner l&#39;IA dans leurs fiches de poste comptables, nous l&#39;intégrons déjà au cœur de nos processus. Nous sommes en avance sur le marché — et nous assumons cette ambition.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nous recherchons un(e) General Accountant Lead &amp;amp; Analyst pour rejoindre l&#39;équipe General Ledger (GL). Ce rôle est bien plus qu&#39;un poste de comptable senior : vous couvrirez l&#39;intégralité des flux d&#39;activités courantes (cycles fournisseurs, clients, immobilisations), avec un fort degré de reporting transverse en clôture, tout en portant un œil critique de contrôle de gestion sur les opérations. Vous serez à la fois garant(e) de la qualité des comptes, pilote de la transformation IA de l&#39;équipe et business partner pour les directions Finance et opérationnelles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Si vous cherchez un poste où la comptabilité rime avec impact stratégique, transformation digitale et leadership — ce rôle est fait pour vous.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos responsabilités incluent, mais ne sont pas limitées à :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Piloter l&#39;ensemble des cycles comptables courants (fournisseurs, clients, immobilisations, charges) et garantir leur fiabilité à l&#39;échelle du groupe, en intégrant systématiquement une revue analytique de type contrôle de gestion (Réel vs Budget/N-1, détection d&#39;anomalies, anticipation des impacts P&amp;amp;L)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Orchestrer les processus de clôture de bout en bout dans une posture de « tour de contrôle » : coordination inter-équipes, reporting transverse, allocation analytique des coûts, contrôle interne et documentation SOX intégrés au quotidien&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Identifier et piloter des projets de transformation digitale et IA (agents Dust, solutions R2R, RPA) et construire des livrables autoportés (dashboards self-service, KPIs dynamiques) pour réduire les sollicitations ad hoc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Standardiser les pratiques comptables groupe et contribuer au « kit d&#39;intégration comptable » pour accompagner l&#39;internationalisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Incarner la posture de business partner en traduisant les enjeux comptables en langage business et en assurant une veille réglementaire active&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les qualités attendues pour ce poste&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Avant de poursuivre votre lecture, si vous n&#39;avez pas le profil exact décrit ci-dessous, mais que vous pensez que cette description de poste correspond à vos compétences et à vos aspirations, nous vous encourageons tout de même à postuler.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vous pourrez être le/la prochain(e) membre de notre équipe si vous :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Disposez d&#39;une formation supérieure en Comptabilité/Finance (DSCG, Master CCA, Grande École, DEC en cours ou obtenu)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Justifiez de 8 à 10 ans d&#39;expérience en comptabilité générale et/ou audit, dont au moins 3 ans en position de management ou de leadership technique&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Avez une expérience significative en Big 4 (Manager/Senior Manager) et/ou en entreprise internationale en forte croissance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Maîtrisez les normes IFRS (dont IFRS 16, 15) et French GAAP, et avez une expérience approfondie des environnements SOX&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Faites preuve d&#39;un esprit analytique fort et d&#39;une capacité à intégrer une démarche de contrôle de gestion dans votre pratique comptable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Êtes à l&#39;aise avec les ERP modernes et maîtrisez Excel/Google Sheets à un niveau avancé&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Parlez anglais couramment (C1/C2) — échanges quotidiens avec les équipes internationales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Êtes un(e) leader naturel(le), capable de fédérer, mentorer et conduire le changement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce serait fantastique si vous aviez aussi :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Une expérience dans le secteur Tech/SaaS et/ou en environnement multi-pays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Une connaissance de SAP et/ou Coupa&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Une familiarité avec les outils BI (Looker, Tableau) et les solutions de close management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Une expérience démontrée avec des outils d&#39;IA appliqués à la comptabilité (agents IA, RPA, OCR intelligent, modèles prédictifs) ou une forte appétence pour ces sujets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Une compréhension des mécanismes de consolidation et des enjeux de corporate finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Notre offre&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Une mutuelle avantageuse prise en charge à 100 % par Doctolib (régime de base) pour les employés et leurs enfants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;25 jours de congés payés et jusqu&#39;à 14 jours de RTT par an&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Un programme de santé mentale et de coaching personnalisé gratuit avec notre partenaire Moka.care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Un programme d&#39;intégration complet de 3 mois incluant la Doctolib Academy et diverses formations (langues, soft skills, compétences techniques)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Un accès aux meilleurs outils IA et des formations dédiées&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Un mois de congé supplémentaire au congé parental légal grâce au programme « Parent Care »&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;10 jours par an de télétravail à l&#39;étranger possible (UE et UK)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhésion au plan de partage de la valeur de Doctolib, appelé DoctoGrowth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Des tickets restaurant d&#39;une valeur de 8,50 € par jour, dont 4,50 € pris en charge par Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Un remboursement à 50 % de l&#39;abonnement aux transports en commun&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Pour les salariés en situation de handicap ou proches aidants, un package comprenant une adaptation du télétravail, des jours d&#39;absence autorisée payés pour les rendez-vous médicaux et un soutien psychologique renforcé&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le processus de recrutement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Premier entretien avec l&#39;équipe recrutement (30 min)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Entretien opérationnel avec le Directeur Comptable (1h)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Cas pratique technique (1h)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Entretien final avec un membre du leadership Finance (45 min)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Au minimum une prise de référence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Détails du poste&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;CDI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Temps plein&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Lieu de travail : Levallois-Perret&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Prise de poste : dès que possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Rémunération : fixe + variable sur objectifs (selon profil)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Ce poste est éligible au télétravail partiel (2 jours/semaine)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p4&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Doctolib, nous sommes convaincus que nous devons améliorer la santé pour tout le monde. Cela se reflète dans notre processus de recrutement. Nous évaluons les candidatures uniquement sur la base des qualifications et de la motivation, sans aucune forme de discrimination.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Plus les idées sont diverses, plus notre produit améliorera véritablement la santé pour tout le monde. Vous pouvez postuler chez Doctolib, quel que soit votre genre, religion, âge, orientation sexuelle, origine ethnique ou handicap.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Afin de garantir l&#39;égalité des chances, nous vous invitons à exclure les informations personnelles (par exemple : photos, âge) de vos candidatures. Si vous avez besoin d&#39;aménagements particuliers, merci de nous en informer pour que nous puissions adapter le processus de recrutement. Rejoignez-nous pour construire la santé dont nous rêvons tous !&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Toutes les informations fournies sont traitées par Doctolib pour la gestion des candidatures. Pour plus de détails sur le traitement des données, cliquez ici. Veuillez contacter hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com pour toute question ou pour exercer vos droits.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;We’re on a mission to become the go-to destination for students across Europe to find a trusted home away from home. We make every step of the rental journey simple and seamless, so students can focus on what really matters: studying, exploring, and growing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With HousingAnywhere, Kamernet, and Studapart under our roof, we’re Europe’s largest student rental platform. You’ll find us in Rotterdam, Paris, and Cergy, always guided by our four core values: Ownership, We are enablers, We are changemakers, and We are connectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To support our continued growth, we are creating a new, strategic role at the heart of operational performance and customer experience. There is no Quality &amp;amp; Training activity in the Group today : you will build it from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Quality &amp;amp; Training Manager, you will create and lead the Quality &amp;amp; Training activity for the whole HousingAnywhere Group, covering the Operations teams in Cergy and Rotterdam. You define its scope, methods and tools, and you are responsible for service quality and operational practices across the Group.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You work closely with the managers of the Customer Support and Booking Ops teams to structure training, onboarding, quality monitoring and performance tooling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role is based in France, with frequent travel to our Rotterdam office. English is the main working language.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building the Quality &amp;amp; Training activity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design the Quality &amp;amp; Training activity : scope, operating model, priorities and roadmap,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up the tools, rituals and governance needed to run the activity at Group level,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Harmonise quality and training practices between the Cergy and Rotterdam teams,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lay the foundations for the activity to grow as needs evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training &amp;amp; onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify the training needs of the Ops teams, and accompany the integration process while migrating to a single operating model in 2027,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop complete training programmes covering customer service posture, tools, and day-to-day processes and procedures,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain training materials (scripts, practical guides, process sheets, e-learning content), working with the other departments like Product for new features,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a structured onboarding and support new joiners in live situations after initial training, to bridge theory and practice,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out an individual assessment at the end of onboarding (audits, call listening, double listening, tests) and provide personalised follow-up,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead group and one-to-one sessions, on-the-spot debriefs and targeted coaching on the fundamentals: call handling, request qualification, rephrasing, quality of written and spoken answers, and CRM data entry,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train teams on new procedures and tool changes as they are rolled out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality &amp;amp; operational performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and roll out quality standards and control frameworks for each team, across the full user journey,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build structured quality reporting by individual, team and business unit, with a monthly report to managers,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse interactions, indicators and recurring errors to identify root causes and drive continuous improvement plans,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Ops Project Manager to maintain the knowledge base,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a culture of knowledge sharing and self-learning (e-learning) to reduce reliance on informal mentoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to Voice of Customer and customer satisfaction projects by sharing pain points identified through quality monitoring,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propose initiatives to align operational practices with company strategy and the user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise and support managers on using tools and analysing performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in training, quality management or quality monitoring of customer service or operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building a quality or training activity from scratch, or a strong drive to do so,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience setting up a quality monitoring programme (call listening, audits, calibration),&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of customer service best practices and operational process management,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyse spoken and written interactions and turn them into concrete recommendations,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teaching skills, structure and a results focus, with the ability to convince and motivate teams,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with CRM and telephony tools, e-learning content creation and performance dashboards,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English and French are required. English is the main working language,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel frequently to Rotterdam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this opportunity?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A newly created role: you build the Group&#39;s Quality &amp;amp; Training activity from the ground up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Group-wide impact across our teams in Cergy and Rotterdam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high level of autonomy to design tools, processes and training materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An international environment, working between France and the Netherlands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A role combining training, quality and operations, both strategic and hands-on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position based in our Cergy office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive status with 218 workdays/year (with RTT days off).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;50% transport costs covered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;70% health insurance coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal vouchers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribution to fitness membership costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Christmas gift vouchers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team-building events and much more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Read more about our France-based teams &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.welcometothejungle.com/en/companies/studapart&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The CSA role is a pivotal addition to our customer success team, focusing on building strong, consultative relationships with our key customers. Our CSAs will serve as trusted advisors, leveraging their deep understanding of DevSecOps best practices, industry trends and our software capabilities to help customers navigate complex challenges and achieve their desired outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additionally, our team serves as liaisons between the customer and the GitLab ecosystem, streamlining collaboration with Product Management, Engineering, Sales, Professional Services, and others.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/customer-success/csm/&quot;&gt;CSM handbook&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our customers in taking what was established in the pre-sales command plan, and turning the customers desired positive business outcomes into actionable objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know the GitLab platform, our more common best practices, and use cases in order to guide the customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the customer journey and be able to guide them on future adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the GitLab liaison for GitLab questions, issues, or escalations. Work with GitLab Support, Product Management (i.e., roadmaps), or other teams as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a book of assigned customers, with a focus on increasing adoption, ensuring retention and growth, and overall customer satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remain knowledgeable and up-to-date on GitLab releases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide immediate onboarding activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with assigned customers to build Customer Success Plans, establishing critical goals, or other key performance indicators and aid the customer in achieving their goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Program manage account escalations Provide insights with respect to the availability and applicability of new features in GitLab as relevant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support GitLab Services in identifying and recommending training opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Git and typical branching strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of software development lifecycle and development pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of continuous integration, continuous deployment, DevSecOps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in Customer Success or equivalent history of increasing satisfaction, adoption, and retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with customers to define and achieve business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity working with customers of sizes relevant to the assigned segment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional verbal, written, organizational, presentation, and communications skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detailed oriented and analytical Strong team player but self-starter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management experience &amp;amp; skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical, analytic, and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Alignment with our values, and willingness to work in accordance with those values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel if needed and comply with the company’s travel policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated progressive experience in a related function is required with direct customer advocacy and engagement experience in post-sales or professional services functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent German&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Customer Success Architect (CSA) team focuses on hands-on technical enablement, adoption, utilization and maturity - while maintaining strong customer relationships and business alignment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h4&gt;About the role :&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the heart of our offering is a versatile software platform for orchestrating complex robotic systems, from industrial robot arms and mobile manipulators to humanoids. We bring it into real production environments with international customers and delivery partners, often in applications nobody has automated before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Technical Lead, you are one of the people we turn to when it matters most. When a critical project hits a wall, whether the problem is technical, organizational, or both, you step in, get to the root of it, and get it back on track. You work at the staff level alongside product and project management, and your judgment shapes what we build: which problems the platform solves next, how projects are scoped, and where the technical boundaries lie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Your Responsibilities :&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take technical ownership of our most critical customer projects and turn around those that are off track.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose problems across the whole system: robot hardware, controls, perception, AI models, software, and integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make the call on technical direction when there is no obvious answer, and stand behind it with customers, partners, and management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step into project leadership where needed: re-plan scope, reset expectations, and get the team moving again.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the product roadmap with what you learn in the field, and turn one-off solutions into platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge and sharpen the project scope early, before commitments are made, together with Sales, Pre-Sales, and project management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a technical counterpart for senior customer and partner stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach engineers across teams, and raise the technical bar by example.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Essential Skills&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master&#39;s degree or PhD in Robotics, Computer Science, Mechatronics, Electrical or Mechanical Engineering, or a comparable field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of hands-on experience in robotics, gained in a startup, a research institute, or a comparable environment where you had to cover a broad range of topics yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep technical knowledge across several of these: motion planning and control, perception and computer vision, robot learning or AI models, real-time and embedded systems, and software architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of solving hard problems in real deployments, not just in the lab.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident in taking on project management responsibility when the situation calls for it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communicator who can explain complex technical situations to engineers, customers, and management alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calm, pragmatic, and decisive under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English; willingness to travel to customer sites when a project needs you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Beneficial Skills&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent German; Mandarin is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with humanoids, mobile manipulation, or Vision-Language-Action models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a product company where customer projects drive platform development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with industrial communication protocols, machinery, and functional safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 TranslationField-module__aboutUsWrapper___WXJpq&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A dynamic high-tech company, combined with financial soundness and world-class investors.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Join an interdisciplinary, international team with 60+ different nationalities in a collaborative work environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lots of development opportunities as we continue to grow.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Challenging tasks and impactful projects alongside experts that enable professional and personal growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Corporate Benefits Program covering health, mobility, and learning for 100€ net per month.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Modern office facilities with a rooftop terrace overlooking Munich, free drinks &amp;amp; fruits, and regular company events contribute to a good working environment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemValue___c0djd&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Robots SE&lt;/strong&gt; is an international high-tech company based in Munich, Germany with a production site in Kaufbeuren and more than &lt;strong&gt;3500&lt;/strong&gt; employees worldwide. Our mission is to bridge the gap between artificial intelligence and robotics by developing systems that combine state-of-the-art force-moment-sensing and world-leading image-processing technology. This unique combination of technologies allows us to provide user-friendly and affordable robotic solutions that enable intelligent precision assembly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is made possible by our employees, who bring out the best in each and every day with creativity and enthusiasm. Become part of this team and shape the future of robotics with us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud of our diversity and welcome your application regardless of gender and sexual identity, nationality, ethnicity, religion, age, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The AI Teams at Agile Robots&lt;/strong&gt; are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Machine Learning Engineer (m/f/d) Computer Vision for Robotics&lt;/strong&gt;, who will design and train deep-learning models for visual servoing in precision robot manipulation. Your model&#39;s output steers the robot as it moves, so inference latency and sub-millimetre accuracy both decide whether the task succeeds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Method Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop deep-learning methods for visual servoing and robotic vision, adapting and combining existing methods for new tasks where that requires significant changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model Training:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, train, fine-tune, and evaluate models in PyTorch, including adapting pretrained and foundation models to real robot tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perception Methods:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop 2D and 3D perception for pose estimation, depth, tracking, and geometric understanding, combining learned, classical, and optimization-based methods where each fits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Closed-Loop Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Integrate learned models into closed-loop robot control for high-precision manipulation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Robot Evaluation:&lt;/strong&gt; Evaluate models on real robots and precision manipulation tasks, analyse failure cases, and improve robustness and generalization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real-Time Deployment:&lt;/strong&gt; Build real-time inference pipelines in C++ and Python and optimize models with ONNX, TensorRT, and CUDA to meet the timing of the control loop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Master&#39;s degree or PhD in computer science, robotics, electrical engineering, or a related field, or an equivalent combination of research and industry experience, with three or more years in machine learning, computer vision, or robotics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ML Pipeline:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience designing, training, and tuning deep-learning models end to end in PyTorch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Method Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience adapting, combining, or extending existing machine learning or vision methods for a new task, with changes that required understanding how those methods work internally.&lt;/li&gt;
