&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Maternity/paternity leave: salary maintained at 100% during leave with no seniority requirement. Return to work at 4/5 schedule paid at 100% for 8 weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0&quot;&gt;Sustainable Mobility Package (FMD): €544.80/year (excluding full-remote contracts)&lt;/p&gt;
