&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation and growth drive everything we do. Our Engineering teams tackle complex technical challenges across a global, three-sided marketplace, building and scaling systems that serve millions of customers, riders and partners every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Machine Learning Engineering Manager to join us in London on a hybrid basis (3 days a week). In this role, you’ll lead the team that owns intelligence across our ordering experience, from store page and item selection through cart, upsell and checkout, plus bundling. Personalisation is one of the biggest levers we have to drive value to our customers, and your team will make the app feel less like a generic catalogue and more like one that understands what each customer is trying to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a high-performing team of around 12 Machine Learning Engineers, distributed across multiple pods and spread across London, Finland and Berlin, fostering a culture of technical excellence, ownership and rapid experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and evolve the ranking, recommendation and personalisation systems across ordering surfaces, helping customers find the right items quickly as our selection grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the technical vision for the team’s ML ecosystem, balancing near-term product goals with longer-term bets on areas like on areas across recommendations to agentic approaches, and intent-aware experiences that adapt dynamically to how customers browse and act.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the unification of our recommendation models across brands (Deliveroo, Wolt and DoorDash) and markets, working out how to power personalisation at global scale while keeping it feeling hyperlocal, and how to balance reusable core models against surface-specific adaptations without ending up with a sprawl of models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Data Science and neighbouring engineering teams to identify high-impact opportunities, define roadmaps and translate ambiguous business problems into ML solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical guidance on modelling approaches, ML system design and production architecture, stepping in to challenge modelling decisions where needed without becoming a bottleneck.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive key marketplace metrics such as conversion and engagement, balancing velocity and scope against sustainable, long-term technical quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay close to the code so you understand how your team actually works, and help evolve the AI-assisted engineering practices and tooling that empower the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need to thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience line-managing ML Engineers, ideally 6 or more direct reports, with a track record of building high-performing teams, coaching engineers through career progression and managing a horizontally distributed team across multiple pods or workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience building and deploying machine learning systems in production at scale, in areas like Recommendations, Personalisation, Search, Ranking or Information Retrieval.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management across product, engineering and business functions, with experience working across multiple teams and geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A pragmatic, impact-focused mindset, prioritising outcomes and customer experience over theoretical perfection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters—solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Solve meaningful problems at real scale - &lt;/strong&gt;Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;See your impact, fast - &lt;/strong&gt;Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Grow through challenge and ownership - &lt;/strong&gt;Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;A culture built for builders - &lt;/strong&gt;High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;​​💰 &lt;strong&gt;Share in the success you help create - &lt;/strong&gt;Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➡️ Want a deeper look at how we build? Check out our&lt;a href=&quot;https://deliveroo.engineering/&quot;&gt; Tech Blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Your job is to make sure every payout and transaction lands with the right person.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have spent years getting very good at protecting the things a marketplace has always had to protect: checkout fraud, account takeover, courier abuse. But we are no longer only a marketplace. We now issue banking products, lend to merchants, move instant payouts to couriers, and collect cash on the doorstep. Every one of those is a new way for money to leave the platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a new team, and it owns that surface: fraud wherever money moves through the platform. Who receives it, who lends it, who collects it, and who holds it in a financial account. Think instant payout rails, merchant cash advances, and platform-issued banking and earned-wage products serving millions of couriers and merchants. These are live loss surfaces, and the volume grows with every financial product we launch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are now looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Backend Engineer (Golang)&lt;/strong&gt; to build that protection. You will design and ship real-time detection and automated enforcement for our financial products across DoorDash, Wolt, and Deliveroo. The work is high-throughput, low-latency, and unusually consequential: a rule you ship on Monday can stop a serious loss by Friday. It is also close to greenfield, so you will be setting the patterns every future financial product inherits on day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be based in &lt;strong&gt;London&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;UK&lt;/strong&gt; as one of the founding engineering roles in our London hub, working closely with our teams in Helsinki and Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain high-throughput, low-latency backend services in Go that score financial events in real time, including payout enrollments, bank account links, credit applications, and account-to-account transfers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design fraud detection and automated enforcement for our financial products end to end: from signal collection through to the decision that blocks a fraudulent payout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build on and extend our shared fraud decisioning platform, so signals, rules, and models work across all three of our brands instead of being rebuilt three times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with risk analysts, data scientists, and product managers to turn observed fraud patterns into shipped detection, and to know when a rule, a model, or a product change is the right answer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across team boundaries with our account security, payments fraud, and financial product teams. We build on their signals rather than rebuild them, so clean interfaces matter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to architectural discussions and technical decisions as we establish the fraud infrastructure baseline for financial products, with support from senior engineers on the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write well-tested, observable code and help the team hold a high quality bar. In fraud, a silent failure is a loss event.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our expectations:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 to 6 years of professional software engineering experience, including backend services you have shipped and owned in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of production experience in Golang, or strong experience in another backend language and real enthusiasm for picking Go up quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A working understanding of low-latency, high-throughput distributed systems. Real-time decisioning comes with a latency budget, and you are keen to learn to build inside one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with SQL and/or NoSQL databases, and some exposure to event-driven architectures (Kafka or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to operate what you build, including a share of on-call, with a pragmatic approach to reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uses AI tooling in day-to-day development and can critically evaluate its output for correctness and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fraud, risk, payments, lending, or financial crime, especially money movement fraud, bank account linking fraud, payout abuse, or lending fraud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with rules engines, real-time feature stores, or ML model serving in a decisioning path.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in Kotlin, Java, Python, or Node.js alongside Go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cloud infrastructure (AWS, GCP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across multiple brands, regions, or regulatory regimes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A product-oriented mindset. You think beyond the ticket, understand the &quot;why&quot; behind the work, and take a high level of responsibility for outcomes rather than output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity. This is a new team on a new surface; parts of the charter are still being drawn, and you will help draw them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of owning a project or feature end to end, especially in fast-paced environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear and proactive communication, with a collaborative spirit. We work across three companies and several time zones, so we move fast, but we succeed together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An adversarial instinct. The best fraud engineers enjoy thinking like the attacker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;About Baringa&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence – all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly – all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Certified as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Great Place to Work &lt;/em&gt;around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the &lt;em&gt;Financial Times &lt;/em&gt;in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by &lt;em&gt;Forbes &lt;/em&gt;for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Introducing the baringa.ai Fellowship - &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun  BCX8 SCXP12218987&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-scheme-color=&quot;@19BCEB,,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun  BCX8 SCXP12218987&quot;&gt;A selective cohort for exceptional postgraduate talent.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP  BCX8 SCXP12218987&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At Baringa, we blend technical expertise with real-world insight to make an impact. Work with experienced engineers and experts on real client challenges from day one. We seek curious, technically skilled individuals who can translate complex ideas into clear, practical solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We’re looking for people talented individuals who have recently completed their Masters or PhD, who want to take their technical depth and apply it to interesting and cutting edge challenges. We expect that you might have spent time in research, built something outside your studies, or developed deep expertise in a particular area. What matters most is how you think, what you can do, and how quickly you can turn that into something useful.​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Join a select cohort built around exceptional technical talent, with the chance to grow together and make an impact. You’ll work on challenging problems, learn from people at the top of their field and build a career at the forefront of AI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
