&lt;p&gt;Grocery shopping is personal, frequent and essential. Designing for it is a rare challenge: high-impact, deeply human, and never truly finished. At Picnic, your work won&#39;t just be seen. It will be part of how people feed their families.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
