&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Customer Success Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:257}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;With a presence in the USA, UK and Philippines, the Customer Success Team manages clients across North America and Europe, with the expectation of adding further clients in the APAC region.&amp;nbsp; It ensures clients gain and exceed the expected business benefits from their existing contract and creates a service environment where contract renewal naturally occurs and contract expansion can be easily achieved.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:257}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
