&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Founding GTM Engineering Lead (GrowthBricks)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you someone who likes to build GTM systems from the ground up? Have you built sales automations, signal-based workflows, account intelligence systems, or AI-powered GTM solutions yourself?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Founding GTM Engineering Lead&lt;/strong&gt; to build GrowthBricks with us, turning real GTM problems into working systems and using what we learn to shape the product itself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About JetBrains&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We create intelligent software development tools for developers and teams. More than 15 million users, over 300,000 companies, and 88 of the Fortune Global Top 100 rely on our products to solve real, complex problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;JetMinds is a new JetBrains-backed venture focused on AI-native GTM tools, and GrowthBricks is one of its new projects, designed to give GTM teams and AI agents a shared business brain. It brings together business context that’s usually fragmented across CRMs, calls, documents, dashboards, and other tools, giving people and AI agents the context they need to make better decisions and execute effectively across the sales and marketing stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own our early customer implementations and help the founding team shape the product around what actually works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working directly with customers, you&#39;ll figure out their GTM operations, identify where agentic automations can help, and build solutions around those needs. Alongside the product and technical founders, you’ll use what you learn from these implementations to shape GrowthBricks itself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Day to day, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with customers to understand their GTM workflows, systems, data, and bottlenecks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn ambiguous business problems into working GTM systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build signal pipelines, account intelligence systems, enrichment and qualification workflows, outbound and CRM automation, and agentic workflows using GrowthBricks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hands-on with tools such as CRMs, enrichment platforms, sales engagement tools, APIs, automation platforms, and AI agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect GrowthBricks to customers’ existing GTM stack rather than rebuilding it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify patterns across customers and turn them into reusable product capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the product founder and engineering team to shape GrowthBricks, including building and shipping features yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication across roles. You can work effectively with founders, sales and marketing teams, RevOps specialists, and engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity. You can take an unclear business problem and work toward a concrete solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product instinct. You can recognize which customer problems should become part of the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical mindset. You value working systems over unnecessary complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong, practical understanding of modern B2B GTM operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building sales automation, enrichment workflows, signal-based GTM systems, or similar infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with modern GTM tooling such as Clay, TheirStack, or FullEnrich.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience connecting multiple systems using APIs, webhooks, scripts, or custom integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience using LLMs or agents for GTM research, qualification, personalization, and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing GTM systems across multiple teams or customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The technical ability to build and modify product features and working solutions yourself, rather than just specifying what others should build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your first six months, you will have taken several customer problems from discovery to working production workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also have helped us understand where GrowthBricks creates the most value, identified patterns that repeat across customers, and turned those patterns into reusable product capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success means building systems that customers actually use, producing measurable GTM outcomes, and making the product materially better with every implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join JetBrains?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong base salary. We offer competitive pay that reflects your skills and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meaningful ownership. You will help shape the product, implementation model, and direction of GrowthBricks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work schedule. Enjoy the freedom to work from home or from the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra time off. More days to relax and recharge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities. Access to conferences, courses, and language classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation support. Assistance to help make your move as smooth and stress-free as possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health and wellness. On-site gyms or sports club stipends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal events. Company-wide celebrations and team gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer. We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like a challenge you&#39;d enjoy, we’d love to hear from you. Send us your CV or LinkedIn profile and, more importantly, show us something you’ve built: a GTM system, automation, agent, workflow, or customer implementation you’re particularly proud of.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-IM1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We process the data provided in your job application in accordance with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/privacy/privacy-recruitment/&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;KnowBe4 empowers the modern workforce to make smarter security decisions every day. Trusted by more than 70,000 organizations worldwide, KnowBe4 is the pioneer of digital workforce security, securing both AI agents and humans. The KnowBe4 Platform provides attack simulation and training, collaboration security, and agent security powered by AIDA (Artificial Intelligence Defense Agents) and a proprietary Risk Score. The platform leverages 15-years of behavioral data to combat advanced threats including social engineering, prompt injection, and shadow AI. By securing humans and agents, KnowBe4 leads the industry in workforce trust and defense.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.knowbe4.com/hubfs/Careers/EXTERNAL%20LINKS%20-%20Do%20Not%20Delete/NL%20Utrecht.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;225&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Please submit your resume in English.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;To learn more about our team and office culture in the Netherlands, visit the following links.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Careers Page:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.knowbe4.com/careers/locations/utrecht&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.knowbe4.com/careers/locations/utrecht&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;https://www.knowbe4.com/careers/locations/utrecht&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;Glassdoor:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.com/Location/KnowBe4-Utrecht-Location-EI_IE969384.0,7_IL.8,15_IC3045310.htm&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.com/Location/KnowBe4-Utrecht-Location-EI_IE969384.0,7_IL.8,15_IC3045310.htm&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;https://www.glassdoor.com/Location/KnowBe4-Utrecht-Location-EI_IE969384.0,7_IL.8,15_IC3045310.htm&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;LinkedIn:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/knowbe4/life/netherlands/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/knowbe4/life/netherlands/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;https://www.linkedin.com/company/knowbe4/life/netherlands/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Account Executive (Mid-Market) (International) position is responsible for identifying and acquiring new logos within the Mid-Market business segment to meet and exceed their monthly sales quota. This can be achieved by creating opportunities through various prospecting methods, following up on inbound leads, as well as reigniting open, outstanding customer opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acquire Mid-Market-sized new logo accounts within assigned territory to meet and exceed monthly sales quota.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a pipeline of Mid-Market business opportunities by various prospecting methods, following lead cadence best practices, and conducting demos of our suite of products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Articulate the value proposition of KnowBe4’s full suite of products and educate the customer how each product will improve their business’s human firewall.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand an organization’s buying needs, key decision makers, potential roadblocks and next steps to shorten sales cycles and acquire a high volume of new logo accounts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act strategically in offering subscription levels, multi-year deals and/or negotiating discounted pricing to increase ARR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate and thorough records of daily sales statistics via Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the assigned Channel sales representative to seamlessly close new logos through our Partner business channels. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;2-3 years experience selling to Mid-Market sized businesses&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bachelor Degree or higher education equivalent, desirable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with standard concepts, practices and procedures within the IT, Security or Cybersecurity industry, desirable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience with Salesforce, a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience with Gmail and Google Docs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience with MS Office (Word and Excel)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience with web browsers (Chrome, Internet Explorer, etc.)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Excellent verbal and written communications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Stats driven business professional&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Motivated, energetic self-starter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong collaborative and teamwork skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Must be able to work with minimum supervision&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Fluent in German&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Fantastic Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;We offer company-wide bonuses based on monthly sales targets, employee referral bonuses, adoption assistance, tuition reimbursement, certification reimbursement, and certification completion bonuses - all in a modern, high-tech, and fun work environment. For more details about our benefits in each office location, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.knowbe4.com/careers/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.knowbe4.com/careers/benefits&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1727463125306000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3gDeHkHPZYOcR3fRjLcL4_&quot;&gt;www.knowbe4.com/careers/benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
