&lt;p data-start=&quot;2229&quot; data-end=&quot;2278&quot;&gt;Experience with commercial or financial systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2279&quot; data-end=&quot;2345&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2281&quot; data-end=&quot;2345&quot;&gt;Familiarity with ERP integrations (AFAS, Dynamics, or similar)&lt;/p&gt;
