&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;text-start&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our delivery teams. Working closely with&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;text-start&quot;&gt;Sales Directors and the Software&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;text-start&quot;&gt;Ambassador, the Commercial Software Lead is the expert in the room—driving adoption of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;text-start&quot;&gt;Software&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;text-start&quot;&gt;proposition&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;text-start&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;text-start&quot;&gt;and turning market-leading software services into signed contracts and successful customer outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;text-start&quot;&gt;Your&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;text-start&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
